f paperwise. I surprised myself since I am a dance teacher and never really worked on stuff like that! I&#039;m sharing what I have made to help out other brides! It has cut costs with DIY and not buying stuff off etsy, etc. Enjoy! Let me know if is does not work! I can also attach the pdf since I have downloaded alot of fonts which might not load on your computer when you open them!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898780,"PostDate":1434551831,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This whole wedding process I have done alot of my own design stuff paperwise. I surprised myself since I am a dance teacher and never really worked on stuff like that! I'm sharing what I have made to help out other brides! It has cut costs with DIY and not buying stuff off etsy, etc. Enjoy! Let me know if is does not work! I can also attach the pdf since I have downloaded alot of fonts which might not load on your computer when you open them!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jsparrow@kent.edu","IpAddress":"74.218.117.250","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1400503542,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jsparrow10","Id":278025,"Name":"jsparrow10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.41.201.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"Ca