{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":26,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":2570,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1236146,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":224781,"Name":"JanineA","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224781.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1280394666,"LastPoster":{"Id":282278,"Name":"RitvikSehgal","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282278.png?_r=1425103909","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":242,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":45,"Preview":{"Id":1236146,"PostDate":1280394666,"PostContent":"Sorry if there is already another thread with this but I searched and couldn't find one. My dj j...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janinelatkinson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1263754522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224781.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JanineA","Id":224781,"Name":"JanineA","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55473,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8c02a9c4b5f33bf0e9cd5eedb1ee33cd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Sorry if there is already another thread with this but I searched and couldn&#039;t find one. My dj just asked me what is the format of my reception and I have no clue. I was thinking something as follows:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Arrival of guests&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Intro of Bridal Party&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Intro of Newlyweds&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Dinner (during dinner have the speeches by MOH and Best Man and toasts)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; First Dance&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Bride\/Father Dance&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Groom\/Mother Dance&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Cake Cutting&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Everyone get down and boogy&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; What are you ladies doing? What is your format going to look like? I have been to 6 weddings already for the year and sadly I can&#039;t even remember what the format was like. I was just at two on Saturday alone....lol. I&#039;m attending another one this Saturday, perhaps I will pay better attention. Would love to hear your thoughts though.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1236146,"PostDate":1280394666,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Sorry if there is already another thread with this but I searched and couldn't find one. My dj just asked me what is the format of my reception and I have no clue. I was thinking something as follows:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Arrival of guests<\/p> <p> Intro of Bridal Party<\/p> <p> Intro of Newlyweds<\/p> <p> Dinner (during dinner have the speeches by MOH and Best Man and toasts)<\/p> <p> First Dance<\/p> <p> Bride\/Father Dance<\/p> <p> Groom\/Mother Dance<\/p> <p> Cake Cutting<\/p> <p> Everyone get down and boogy<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> What are you ladies doing? What is your format going to look like? I have been to 6 weddings already for the year and sadly I can't even remember what the format was like. I was just at two on Saturday alone....lol. I'm attending another one this Saturday, perhaps I will pay better attention. Would love to hear your thoughts though.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janinelatkinson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1263754522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224781.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JanineA","Id":224781,"Name":"JanineA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55473,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"33b3d3b6592019dbf5a9c31463749019","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; *bump*&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1241444,"PostDate":1280833429,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> *bump*<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janinelatkinson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1263754522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224781.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JanineA","Id":224781,"Name":"JanineA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55473,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"761a8abdef62c7ae0ed359351b7734dc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m doing the same order..&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1241450,"PostDate":1280833754,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm doing the same order..<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Mrs. Smith!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.harmoneybillpay.com\">www.harmoneybillpay.com<\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mandieal40@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1275075116,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228658.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MsSmithtobe","Id":228658,"Name":"MsSmithtobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55473,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"897e876a757f76c9c99ff1d535adc04f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I think ours will be in the same order.&amp;nbsp; Though we don&#039;t have a dj so I don&#039;t know who really controls the flow of things...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1241494,"PostDate":1280835002,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I think ours will be in the same order.\u00a0 Though we don't have a dj so I don't know who really controls the flow of things...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lyndsayhamilton@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1269217410,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226646.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lyndsay_h","Id":226646,"Name":"lyndsay_h","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55473,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5ed8a1dffd7077d2150a1fdf90072198","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Lyndsay_h are you using an ipod? Who will be controlling the music for your ipod, another family member or someone from the resort?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1241501,"PostDate":1280835150,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Lyndsay_h are you using an ipod? Who will be controlling the music for your ipod, another family member or someone from the resort?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janinelatkinson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1263754522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224781.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JanineA","Id":224781,"Name":"JanineA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55473,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f96763e971b7b63466a3786608e64245","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We&#039;ll have an ipod.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m trying to get all the playlists in the order they need to be played, then I think we&#039;ll ask a friend to watch over it, change playlists when they need it.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m not sure about&amp;nbsp;playing music&amp;nbsp;for the ceremony though.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1241595,"PostDate":1280839806,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We'll have an ipod.\u00a0 I'm trying to get all the playlists in the order they need to be played, then I think we'll ask a friend to watch over it, change playlists when they need it.\u00a0 I'm not sure about\u00a0playing music\u00a0for the ceremony though.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lyndsayhamilton@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1269217410,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226646.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lyndsay_h","Id":226646,"Name":"lyndsay_h","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55473,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dae57777cbd9bf3031d83c735fcbe116","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Well in my experience with weddings.&amp;nbsp; I used to work as a bridal assistant and ran weddings at a Banquet facilities here in NJ.&amp;nbsp; The following is the basic format:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Guest get seated for the reception&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Parents get introduced&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Bridal party gets introduced and usually lined up in formation for an arc&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Bride and Groom get introduced&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; immediately following&amp;nbsp;First dance&amp;nbsp;first course is either out on table or is being served&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; right after the father daughter dance&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Than the second course comes out&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; speeches start&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; than the main course any final speeches or videos to show the guests are done during this while everyone is eating&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; than it&#039;s time to partyyyyyyyyyyyy&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; than a break for cake(if you are cutting cake)\/Garter and Bouquet Toss&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Dessert and more PARTY&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The main reason we did the parent dances in the beginning were for several reasons one was ALCOHOL either for you, your parent or the guests.&amp;nbsp; Nothing ruins an intimate moment as someone falling in the middle of the dance or shouting cause they are too drunk to think about what they are doing.&amp;nbsp; Also you want to do all this stuff while everyone is still sober and eating at the tables and not stop the dancing and try to gather everyone to sit at their tables.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My plan is very simple and are still working on it:&amp;nbsp; I am most likely not doing parent intro or bridal party&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Bride and Groom intro&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; First dance&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; (no father daughter dance as I don&#039;t have a dad and his passed)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; EAT &amp;amp; drink&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Speech during dinner or earlier&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Cake cutting&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; than Dancing the night away&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; i am still debating on the garter and bouquet toss.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1242264,"PostDate":1280872589,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Well in my experience with weddings.\u00a0 I used to work as a bridal assistant and ran weddings at a Banquet facilities here in NJ.\u00a0 The following is the basic format:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Guest get seated for the reception<\/p> <p> Parents get introduced<\/p> <p> Bridal party gets introduced and usually lined up in formation for an arc<\/p> <p> Bride and Groom get introduced<\/p> <p> immediately following\u00a0First dance\u00a0first course is either out on table or is being served<\/p> <p> right after the father daughter dance<\/p> <p> Than the second course comes out<\/p> <p> speeches start<\/p> <p> than the main course any final speeches or videos to show the guests are done during this while everyone is eating<\/p> <p> than it's time to partyyyyyyyyyyyy<\/p> <p> than a break for cake(if you are cutting cake)\/Garter and Bouquet Toss<\/p> <p> Dessert and more PARTY<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The main reason we did the parent dances in the beginning were for several reasons one was ALCOHOL either for you, your parent or the guests.\u00a0 Nothing ruins an intimate moment as someone falling in the middle of the dance or shouting cause they are too drunk to think about what they are doing.\u00a0 Also you want to do all this stuff while everyone is still sober and eating at the tables and not stop the dancing and try to gather everyone to sit at their tables.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My plan is very simple and are still working on it:\u00a0 I am most likely not doing parent intro or bridal party<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Bride and Groom intro<\/p> <p> First dance<\/p> <p> (no father daughter dance as I don't have a dad and his passed)<\/p> <p> EAT & drink<\/p> <p> Speech during dinner or earlier<\/p> <p> Cake cutting<\/p> <p> than Dancing the night away<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> i am still debating on the garter and bouquet toss.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Jennifer & Eugene - May 7,2011 Dreams La Romana, Dominican Republic<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jenngene2011@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1265316516,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225340.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jenngene2011","Id":225340,"Name":"jenngene2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55473,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"672b552987f59c5859734581d161ff65","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I didn&#039;t think I had to plan the order of events....I am hoping the WC will take care of all that.&amp;nbsp; &lt;img alt=\"\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile35.gif\" title=\"\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1242507,"PostDate":1280911266,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I didn't think I had to plan the order of events....I am hoping the WC will take care of all that.\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile35.gif\" title=\"\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mbockman3@al.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1279676455,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230480.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mrs.S2B","Id":230480,"Name":"Mrs.S2B","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55473,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1719eab68af6c98c6cf1fbf8b3333e1b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; The WC should take care of however since it is a destination wedding and from what I hear they are very busy if you want to keep everything organized and prepared&amp;nbsp;instead of wondering when to do what the day of.&amp;nbsp; It is good to at least have an idea of what you want.&amp;nbsp; As soon don&#039;t want to do traditional wedding reception stuff.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1242696,"PostDate":1280919167,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> The WC should take care of however since it is a destination wedding and from what I hear they are very busy if you want to keep everything organized and prepared\u00a0instead of wondering when to do what the day of.\u00a0 It is good to at least have an idea of what you want.\u00a0 As soon don't want to do traditional wedding reception stuff.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Jennifer & Eugene - May 7,2011 Dreams La Romana, Dominican Republic<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jenngene2011@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1265316516,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225340.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jenngene2011","Id":225340,"Name":"jenngene2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55473,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5c60462663d30751e005e7b0495f6e2a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Our was pretty close to what you posted.&amp;nbsp; We didn&#039;t have&amp;nbsp;a DJ though.&amp;nbsp; We just used our iPod and I had my cousin run it and introduce what was happening.&amp;nbsp; It worked out really nicely.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Arrival of guests&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Intro of Bridal Party&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Intro of Newlyweds&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Dinner&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Cake Cutting&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; First Dance&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Bride\/Father Dance&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Everyone else join in for dancing&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1242716,"PostDate":1280919593,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Our was pretty close to what you posted.\u00a0 We didn't have\u00a0a DJ though.\u00a0 We just used our iPod and I had my cousin run it and introduce what was happening.\u00a0 It worked out really nicely.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Arrival of guests<\/p> <p> Intro of Bridal Party<\/p> <p> Intro of Newlyweds<\/p> <p> Dinner<\/p> <p> Cake Cutting<\/p> <p> First Dance<\/p> <p> Bride\/Father Dance<\/p> <p> Everyone else join in for dancing<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Married! -- July 11, 2010<\/span><br><br><span>\"I hope your marriage lasts 10 dog years\" -- what my 4 yr old flower girl had my sister write in my guest book!<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/cassies-planning-thread-60976\/\">My Planning Thread<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"CassieAnne.Smith@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1235518980,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215236.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":229,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cassie","Id":215236,"Name":"Cassie","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"55473","Title":"What is the Format of your Reception??","LastPostDate":1428464687},"Pages":{"TotalItems":26,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
