l keep my format as is. If it needs adjusting once I get there then I will do so.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1249219,"PostDate":1281462413,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks ladies for all the input. Thanks Jenngene!!! I think for now I will keep my format as is. If it needs adjusting once I get there then I will do so.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janinelatkinson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1263754522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224781.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JanineA","Id":224781,"Name":"JanineA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55473,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5f32b3d0589496255e8ef3263b4b6d54","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; thanks so much for this thread, as I had no idea I had to lay out all of these plans\/order.&amp;nbsp; Thanks for all the great tips!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1268898,"PostDate":1282901520,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> thanks so much for this thread, as I had no idea I had to lay out all of these plans\/order.\u00a0 Thanks for all the great tips!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chuckskuce@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1281564880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/9\/9e\/9e599cfe_user-30595-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":270,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CSandCK2","Id":231277,"Name":"CSandCK2","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55473,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bda7ceaa76a9cf46c24b5e5467cb2ea0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I hadnt even started thinking about all this.&amp;nbsp; Thanks everyone for your ideas!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1270202,"PostDate":1282987127,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I hadnt even started thinking about all this.\u00a0 Thanks everyone for your ideas!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Erin & Shane ~ Now Jade Riviera Cancun ~ May 6, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sking24@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1273621989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228112.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SKing24","Id":228112,"Name":"SKing24","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55473,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6808e9c1e0aa82943ac911d2ca90b287","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks for this thread, Janine and all others who posted.. I hadn&#039;t even thought about this. Now that I have, I think mine will&amp;nbsp;go much like yours.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1303072,"PostDate":1286113932,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks for this thread, Janine and all others who posted.. I hadn't even thought about this. Now that I have, I think mine will\u00a0go much like yours.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lmorency21@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"146.121.23.2","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1275338046,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228718.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lisa203","Id":228718,"Name":"lisa203","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55473,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"866d79ece5a41ee90e31b13f75c728b3","RawContent":"This is pretty good! The only think my photographer suggested was to get all of the \"important moments\" out of the way early so they aren&#039;t missed later.  Our photographer isn&#039;t staying the entire reception (we&#039;re using the extra time to do bride\/groom pics before the reception) so we&#039;re doing the cake cutting, first dances, etc all before dinner.  [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]JanineA[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Sorry if there is already another thread with this but I searched and couldn&#039;t find one. My dj just asked me what is the format of my reception and I have no clue. I was thinking something as follows: \n \n Arrival of guests \n Intro of Bridal Party \n Intro of Newlyweds \n Dinner (during dinner have the speeches by MOH and Best Man and toasts) \n First Dance \n Bride\/Father Dance \n Groom\/Mother Dance \n Cake Cutting \n Everyone get down and boogy \n \n What are you ladies doing? What is your format going to look like? I have been to 6 weddings already for the year and sadly I can&#039;t even remember what the format was like. I was just at two on Saturday alone....lol. I&#039;m attending another one this Saturday, perhaps I will pay better attention. Would love to hear your thoughts though.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1349436,"PostDate":1291056275,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> This is pretty good! The only think my photographer suggested was to get all of the \"important moments\" out of the way early so they aren't missed later.\u00a0 Our photographer isn't staying the entire reception (we're using the extra time to do bride\/groom pics before the reception) so we're doing the cake cutting, first dances, etc all before dinner.\u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>JanineA<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Sorry if there is already another thread with this but I searched and couldn't find one. My dj just asked me what is the format of my reception and I have no clue. I was thinking something as follows:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Arrival of guests<\/p> <p> Intro of Bridal Party<\/p> <p> Intro of Newlyweds<\/p> <p> Dinner (during dinner have the speeches by MOH and Best Man and toasts)<\/p> <p> First Dance<\/p> <p> Bride\/Father Dance<\/p> <p> Groom\/Mother Dance<\/p> <p> Cake Cutting<\/p> <p> Everyone get down and boogy<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> What are you ladies doing? What is your format going to look like? I have been to 6 weddings already for the year and sadly I can't even remember what the format was like. I was just at two on Saturday alone....lol. I'm attending another one this Saturday, perhaps I will pay better attention. Would love to hear your thoughts though.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cgeris@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1288043790,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233487.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cgeris","Id":233487,"Name":"cgeris","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55473,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2799aa6405c8fa666a0e7f4c376eb038","RawContent":"Your photographer suggesting to get all of the \"important moments\" done early is definetly a good point to keep in mind, because I think most photographers don&#039;t stay the entire time. Thank you for that tip:) \n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]cgeris[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n This is pretty good! The only think my photographer suggested was to get all of the \"important moments\" out of the way early so they aren&#039;t missed later.  Our photographer isn&#039;t staying the entire reception (we&#039;re using the extra time to do bride\/groom pics before the reception) so we&#039;re doing the cake cutting, first dances, etc all before dinner.  \n Quote: \n Originally Posted by [b]JanineA[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Sorry if there is already another thread with this but I searched and couldn&#039;t find one. My dj just asked me what is the format of my reception and I have no clue. I was thinking something as follows: \n \n Arrival of guests \n Intro of Bridal Party \n Intro of Newlyweds \n Dinner (during dinner have the speeches by MOH and Best Man and toasts) \n First Dance \n Bride\/Father Dance \n Groom\/Mother Dance \n Cake Cutting \n Everyone get down and boogy \n \n What are you ladies doing? What is your format going to look like? I have been to 6 weddings already for the year and sadly I can&#039;t even remember what the format was like. I was just at two on Saturday alone....lol. I&#039;m attending another one this Saturday, perhaps I will pay better attention. Would love to hear your thoughts though.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1350191,"PostDate":1291138888,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Your photographer suggesting to get all of the \"important moments\"\u00a0done early is definetly a good point to keep in mind, because I think most photographers don't stay the entire time. Thank you for that tip:)\u00a0<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>cgeris<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> This is pretty good! The only think my photographer suggested was to get all of the \"important moments\" out of the way early so they aren't missed later.\u00a0 Our photographer isn't staying the entire reception (we're using the extra time to do bride\/groom pics before the reception) so we're doing the cake cutting, first dances, etc all before dinner.\u00a0<\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\"> <span>Quote:<\/span> <div class=\"quote-block\"> Originally Posted by <strong>JanineA<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Sorry if there is already another thread with this but I searched and couldn't find one. My dj just asked me what is the format of my reception and I have no clue. I was thinking something as follows:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Arrival of guests<\/p> <p> Intro of Bridal Party<\/p> <p> Intro of Newlyweds<\/p> <p> Dinner (during dinner have the speeches by MOH and Best Man and toasts)<\/p> <p> First Dance<\/p> <p> Bride\/Father Dance<\/p> <p> Groom\/Mother Dance<\/p> <p> Cake Cutting<\/p> <p> Everyone get down and boogy<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> What are you ladies doing? What is your format going to look like? I have been to 6 weddings already for the year and sadly I can't even remember what the format was like. I was just at two on Saturday alone....lol. I'm attending another one this Saturday, perhaps I will pay better attention. Would love to hear your thoughts though.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> \u00a0<\/div> <\/div> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"delgadot73@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1279816293,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230540.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"delgadot","Id":230540,"Name":"delgadot","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55473,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"21e1f1a2a4dec422babf8ba1f3cd36d0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I hadn&#039;t really thought about this yet and assumed it would be done by the WC - we talked about some general items already.&amp;nbsp; We&#039;re more informal so I think we will just have:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; bride and groom announced&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; first dance&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; dinner (buffet style so I guess its not as critical to time with courses)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; speeches during dinner&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; dancing&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; cake cutting&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; more dancing&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I don&#039;t want to do cake right away - give people a break between dinner and dessert.&amp;nbsp; But I am making sure it&#039;s before the photographer leaves.&amp;nbsp; We are paying him hourly and I believe I have him for about 2-2.5 hours during the reception&amp;nbsp;so cake will be at the 2 hour mark.&amp;nbsp; We&#039;re not doing the bouquet\/garter toss (I honestly don&#039;t think I have anymore single friends to catch it).&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1351466,"PostDate":1291276657,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I hadn't really thought about this yet and assumed it would be done by the WC - we talked about some general items already.\u00a0 We're more informal so I think we will just have:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> bride and groom announced<\/p> <p> first dance<\/p> <p> dinner (buffet style so I guess its not as critical to time with courses)<\/p> <p> speeches during dinner<\/p> <p> dancing<\/p> <p> cake cutting<\/p> <p> more dancing<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I don't want to do cake right away - give people a break between dinner and dessert.\u00a0 But I am making sure it's before the photographer leaves.\u00a0 We are paying him hourly and I believe I have him for about 2-2.5 hours during the reception\u00a0so cake will be at the 2 hour mark.\u00a0 We're not doing the bouquet\/garter toss (I honestly don't think I have anymore single friends to catch it).<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Steph & John........Atlantis.......June 18, 2011......happily married<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"steph@tmgatl.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1283270642,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231931.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"skp1","Id":231931,"Name":"skp1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55473,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"278dd3e911dfa5f0cb97cdad2df4be35","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We&#039;re doing the ipod thing as well - no dj.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We will get our guests to provide us with names of two of their fav songs. and we will set playlists.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I will have my witness announce us (newlyweds)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; As we wait for dinner, we will thank our guests etc. if anyone wants to make speaches during dinner - all the power to them.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; After dinner we&#039;ll cut the cake.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Then head down to the beach for our party; first dance etc.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m really NOT stressing over the order. I chose to do DW just for the reason - no stress; go with the flow kind of thing.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1351548,"PostDate":1291288573,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We're doing the ipod thing as well - no dj.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We will get our guests to provide us with names of two of their fav songs. and we will set playlists.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I will have my witness announce us (newlyweds)<\/p> <p> As we wait for dinner, we will thank our guests etc. if anyone wants to make speaches during dinner - all the power to them.<\/p> <p> After dinner we'll cut the cake.<\/p> <p> Then head down to the beach for our party; first dance etc.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm really NOT stressing over the order. I chose to do DW just for the reason - no stress; go with the flow kind of thing.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"magdal89@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1264375820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225008.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bmadzia1","Id":225008,"Name":"bmadzia1","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":26,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
