,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5922494c63d37b2ada912a3ad782012c","RawContent":"We are walking down and away to Israel Kamakawiwo&#039;s version of Somewhere over the Rainbow and What a beautiful world. It was in 50 first dates.","Attachments":[],"Id":521120,"PostDate":1227814333,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are walking down and away to Israel Kamakawiwo's version of Somewhere over the Rainbow and What a beautiful world. It was in 50 first dates.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Like our first kiss all over again<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"saraece@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1168211240,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207034.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"saraece","Id":207034,"Name":"saraece","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fc3a593ec3eb01397c7507e7fc68bd4a","RawContent":"Saraece I love that song too - that is what we are walking back up the aisle to (recessional?) after the ceremony. It is beachy and happy and I love it!\n I am walking down the aisle to &amp;quot;Home&amp;quot; by Chantal Kreviazuk. The trick for me will be not to cry since when I hear that song, I tend to get teary!","Attachments":[],"Id":521125,"PostDate":1227815407,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Saraece I love that song too - that is what we are walking back up the aisle to (recessional?) after the ceremony. It is beachy and happy and I love it!<br \/> I am walking down the aisle to \"Home\" by Chantal Kreviazuk. The trick for me will be not to cry since when I hear that song, I tend to get teary!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sara.klassen@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1225218911,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212442.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sarafish81","Id":212442,"Name":"sarafish81","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"26025fb3cf9baf4914e3cf965d87dc09","RawContent":"I am working on my music now and I think I am going to have the Bridal Party walk to Bless the Broken Road by Rascal Flatts and then I am going to probably walk to the traditional wedding March.","Attachments":[],"Id":521130,"PostDate":1227816083,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am working on my music now and I think I am going to have the Bridal Party walk to Bless the Broken Road by Rascal Flatts and then I am going to probably walk to the traditional wedding March.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Shannon<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;0\/st\/20090626\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/4ead\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...4ead\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"Shannon_Straughn@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1223074530,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212118.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Solidshan83","Id":212118,"Name":"Solidshan83","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"001268f482ecaf08c4f9178348bcc297","RawContent":"I&#039;m walking down the aisle to Canon in C done in GUITAR. We&#039;re getting married in the Mayan Riviera...so it&#039;s very beachy sounding.","Attachments":[],"Id":521144,"PostDate":1227821197,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm walking down the aisle to Canon in C done in GUITAR. We're getting married in the Mayan Riviera...so it's very beachy sounding.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>THE FUTURE MRS.CRIST<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyjablonski@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1227048611,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212745.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BarceloBride","Id":212745,"Name":"BarceloBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b2d2052842d5c05a78d1532b99f24736","RawContent":"We are walking down the aisle to All That Really Matters by Richie Sambora","Attachments":[],"Id":521161,"PostDate":1227823773,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are walking down the aisle to All That Really Matters by Richie Sambora\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Kelsie and MarcusJune 14, 2008Graduation\/Engagement<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"klhutsell@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1216930799,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210766.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"klhutsell","Id":210766,"Name":"klhutsell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5d5cb7ed3d12fa144443339a78a2892e","RawContent":"We are going to walk down to Sea of Love by Cat Power\n I thought it seemed to really fit with a destination beach theme.. about love, and the sea plus it sounds like there&#039;s a ukelele which seems beachy to me.. and I really love the song","Attachments":[],"Id":521281,"PostDate":1227842898,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are going to walk down to Sea of Love by Cat Power<br \/> I thought it seemed to really fit with a destination beach theme.. about love, and the sea plus it sounds like there's a ukelele which seems beachy to me.. and I really love the song\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicolle_wedding@live.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1224353758,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212315.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":66,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nicollem","Id":212315,"Name":"nicollem","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"878738d8bd0c82430e3b48b22ba44c93","RawContent":"We are going to walk down to Sea of Love by Cat Power\n I thought it seemed to really fit with a destination beach theme.. about love, and the sea plus it sounds like there&#039;s a ukelele which seems beachy to me.. and I really love the song","Attachments":[],"Id":521282,"PostDate":1227842913,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are going to walk down to Sea of Love by Cat Power<br \/> I thought it seemed to really fit with a destination beach theme.. about love, and the sea plus it sounds like there's a ukelele which seems beachy to me.. and I really love the song\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicolle_wedding@live.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1224353758,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212315.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":66,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nicollem","Id":212315,"Name":"nicollem","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"23217e6a7f80b422959408aa6ddaf98a","RawContent":"I LOVE Sea of Love! Great choice! I&#039;m walking down the aisle to Til There Was You by The Beatles. I&#039;m sure Sea of Love will be involved in our wedding in some way too.","Attachments":[],"Id":521288,"PostDate":1227843926,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I LOVE Sea of Love! Great choice! I'm walking down the aisle to Til There Was You by The Beatles. I'm sure Sea of Love will be involved in our wedding in some way too.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"andreajphillips@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.56.10.56","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1213805820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl"