"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":8391,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9c5b911036d61b2a0dd317e3b37eff34","RawContent":"We are dancing to &amp;quot;I&#039;ll back you up&amp;quot; by Dave Matthews Band. Do you have any songs that are special to the two of you?","Attachments":[],"Id":144344,"PostDate":1196180109,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are dancing to \"I'll back you up\" by Dave Matthews Band. Do you have any songs that are special to the two of you?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katesig@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"98.247.242.206","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1154919300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206773.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":85,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"-Kate-","Id":206773,"Name":"-Kate-","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":8391,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3431bcda446bec97c724558615bd1389","RawContent":"I am still pondering this one, I have a couple in mind though and they are country- Rascall Flatts, but I could still change my mind...","Attachments":[],"Id":144349,"PostDate":1196180447,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am still pondering this one, I have a couple in mind though and they are country- Rascall Flatts, but I could still change my mind...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/i641.photobucket.com\/albums\/uu135\/dieselpug\/AdamMay2010226-1.jpg'>http:\/\/i641.photobucket.com\/albums\/u...y2010226-1.jpg<\/a>","Email":"shelleyringrose@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"96.234.167.104","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1181252160,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207447.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MsShelley","Id":207447,"Name":"MsShelley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":8391,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2c47e8766c29f88e03d8118f5a7d8e4b","RawContent":"We used the song More by Harry Connick Jr. We had been having trouble thinking of a song when we went to his concert a few years ago, and he opened with this song. As soon as we heard the first line, we looked at each other and said, &amp;quot;that&#039;s it&amp;quot;, we just knew.","Attachments":[],"Id":144353,"PostDate":1196180599,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We used the song More by Harry Connick Jr. We had been having trouble thinking of a song when we went to his concert a few years ago, and he opened with this song. As soon as we heard the first line, we looked at each other and said, \"that's it\", we just knew.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Jenn & Timm, May 10, 2007<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/my-bermuda-wedding-im-sorry-its-so-long-8592\/\">Review<\/a><span> <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/album.php?aid=20950&id=728115649&l=bf0f74e5e3\">Pictures<\/a><span> <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/album.php?aid=158586&id=728115649&l=9dff242f98\">Pro Pictures<\/a><br><span>\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/timmholmes.wordpress.com\/\">i write to be read<\/a><span>\" Fiction by Timm Holmes<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"calrissian13@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"192.0.217.164","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1187722227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207657.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":90,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jenn79","Id":207657,"Name":"Jenn79","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":8391,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6cf0a2820f989f085b2c6de50f24d3a0","RawContent":"We used Love of My Life by Dave Matthews and Santana..\n \n Matt is a huge Dave Matthews fan and we&#039;ve been to a few concerts together. We liked the hispanic flare that Santana&#039;s guitar brought to it.. our DJ shortened it to about 3 mintues and then went straight into Hips Don&#039;t Lie by Shakira (inside friend&#039;s joke)","Attachments":[],"Id":144358,"PostDate":1196181402,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We used Love of My Life by Dave Matthews and Santana..<br \/> <br \/> Matt is a huge Dave Matthews fan and we've been to a few concerts together. We liked the hispanic flare that Santana's guitar brought to it.. our DJ shortened it to about 3 mintues and then went straight into Hips Don't Lie by Shakira (inside friend's joke)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i148.photobucket.com\/albums\/s22\/cheese_diva\/Maddie%20cake%20smash\/032.jpg\">http:\/\/i148.photobucket.com\/albums\/s...0smash\/032.jpg<\/a><br><span>faberphotography.com<\/span><br><span><a href=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/lilypie.com\/\">http:\/\/lilypie.com\/<\/a><span>\"><img src=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/lb2f.lilypie.com\/Yg4Cm8.png\">http:\/\/lb2f.lilypie.com\/Yg4Cm8.png<\/a><span>\" width=\"400\" height=\"80\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Lilypie Second Birthday tickers\" \/><\/a><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cheese_diva@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1159937880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206995.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cheese_diva","Id":206995,"Name":"cheese_diva","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":8391,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"18102f0364cf1b54824ffed8f8c7fdd6","RawContent":"I am absolutely in love with Alicia Key&#039;s &amp;quot;No One&amp;quot;, but Matt refuses. I am working on it. If not that, I will let him pick something. Probably Frank Sinatra or a classic like that. I have a really hard time with this one and AK song is the only one that I think fits...\n \n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;DRbride&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Wanted to see what you girls plan to use as your first dance song. I have been looking and looking but no luck yet. I really like that new Alicia Keys song, &amp;quot;No One&amp;quot; but that&#039;s just a thought. I am in love with &amp;quot;Somewhere Over the Rainbow&amp;quot; by Israel Kamakawiwo but I don&#039;t know if its appropriate or not. I have to read into the lyrics more. If you haven&#039;t heard that song go onto youtube and check it out. Its so beautiful!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":144365,"PostDate":1196181934,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am absolutely in love with Alicia Key's \"No One\", but Matt refuses. I am working on it. If not that, I will let him pick something. Probably Frank Sinatra or a classic like that. I have a really hard time with this one and AK song is the only one that I think fits...<br \/> <br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>DRbride<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Wanted to see what you girls plan to use as your first dance song. I have been looking and looking but no luck yet. I really like that new Alicia Keys song, \"No One\" but that's just a thought. I am in love with \"Somewhere Over the Rainbow\" by Israel Kamakawiwo but I don't know if its appropriate or not. I have to read into the lyrics more. If you haven't heard that song go onto youtube and check it out. Its so beautiful!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carlydorazio@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.92.56.95","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1177534500,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207375.jpg?_r=1414982962","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"boscobel","Id":207375,"Name":"boscobel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":8391,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5d4fa1a615814e4a1a403457c7927837","RawContent":"We picked Sail away with me honey by David Gray","Attachments":[],"Id":144367,"PostDate":1196182023,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We picked Sail away with me honey by David Gray\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaysgirl119@verizon.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1165115470,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206943.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":66,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jaysgirl119","Id":206943,"Name":"Jaysgirl119","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":8391,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"87c11ea618570880e3fa25eba2760cca","RawContent":"some really good choices so far! i&#039;m not a huge country person and we don&#039;t have any specific songs that are sentimental to us so we can go anywhere with this. i think we might do our slow dance and then choreograph a &amp;quot;fun&amp;quot; surprise dance to a catchy song. this was my fianc\u00a9&#039;s idea!","Attachments":[],"Id":144372,"PostDate":1196182359,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                some really good choices so far! i'm not a huge country person and we don't have any specific songs that are sentimental to us so we can go anywhere with this. i think we might do our slow dance and then choreograph a \"fun\" surprise dance to a catchy song. this was my fianc\u00a9's idea!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i47.photobucket.com\/albums\/f174\/kcarlson322\/wedding3.jpg\">http:\/\/i47.photobucket.com\/albums\/f1...2\/wedding3.jpg<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickertocker.com\/images\/ticker\/ticker_c26820b8a4c1b3c2aa868d6d57e14a79.png\">http:\/\/tickertocker.com\/images\/ticke...6d57e14a79.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kcarlson322@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1195329428,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207946.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DRbride","Id":207946,"Name":"DRbride","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"8391","Title":"What's your first dance song?","LastPostDate":1426606683},"Pages":{"TotalItems":986,"TotalPages":99,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":980},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
