{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":8,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":774,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1873154,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":279912,"Name":"LTR","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1411664022,"LastPoster":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1431039162","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":45,"Preview":{"Id":1873154,"PostDate":1411664022,"PostContent":"Hi, \u00a0 I was wondering what the average price is for a DJ in Cancun? Our wedding is at the rooftop...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ltrawlsrn@aol.com","IpAddress":"216.80.25.163","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411143926,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"LTR","Id":279912,"Name":"LTR","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.124.7.10","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78092,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fe64291c1162822fbc9b1e4db559df09","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I was wondering what the average price is for a DJ in Cancun? Our wedding is at the rooftop at Moon Palace in Cancun\/Riviera Maya and I am trying to figure out what a fair price is.&amp;nbsp; Let me know your thoughts! Thanks&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;LTR&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873154,"PostDate":1411664022,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was wondering what the average price is for a DJ in Cancun? Our wedding is at the rooftop at Moon Palace in Cancun\/Riviera Maya and I am trying to figure out what a fair price is.\u00a0 Let me know your thoughts! Thanks<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>LTR<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ltrawlsrn@aol.com","IpAddress":"216.80.25.163","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411143926,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"LTR","Id":279912,"Name":"LTR","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.208.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78092,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"171c4313bcf284a683af0bbdaeb0ae94","RawContent":"Check into outside vendor fees if you don&#039;t use one they have on their approved list.... But I think $1000-1500 is pretty standard. Then add whatever the outside vendor fee would be. You may be able to find one for $500-$1000 but may be more limited in what they offer \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1873164,"PostDate":1411673288,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Check into outside vendor fees if you don't use one they have on their approved list.... But I think $1000-1500 is pretty standard. Then add whatever the outside vendor fee would be. You may be able to find one for $500-$1000 but may be more limited in what they offer <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78092,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a7b4397d6ab86d00f54b001569a3caad","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I found a reputable outside vendor that is $700 for 4 hours and $100 for each additional hour. Unfortunately my resort charges a $800 vendor fee. The approved vendor wants $700 JUST for basic equipment rental and no actual DJ. A complete DJ package is well over 2k for 4 hours.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873281,"PostDate":1411719406,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I found a reputable outside vendor that is $700 for 4 hours and $100 for each additional hour. Unfortunately my resort charges a $800 vendor fee. The approved vendor wants $700 JUST for basic equipment rental and no actual DJ. A complete DJ package is well over 2k for 4 hours.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lauramthistle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1391606556,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276518.jpg?_r=1394639305","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LauraM","Id":276518,"Name":"LauraM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.124.7.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78092,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"36f9c1a24702744e20b3d4b4977ade77","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you for your input! It seems like you can find one for ~$800, but then you get the resort charging the outside vendor fee... (ours at Moon Palace is $800).&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874109,"PostDate":1412274413,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you for your input! It seems like you can find one for ~$800, but then you get the resort charging the outside vendor fee... (ours at Moon Palace is $800).\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ltrawlsrn@aol.com","IpAddress":"216.80.25.163","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411143926,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"LTR","Id":279912,"Name":"LTR","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.223.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78092,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb4e5e4ad868af93c86f5e6c8fd769e4","RawContent":"Our resort charges $59 per hour. I&#039;m sure he&#039;s just part of the entertainment staff but all reviews, on our thread, seem positive so going for it! \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1874116,"PostDate":1412278524,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Our resort charges $59 per hour. I'm sure he's just part of the entertainment staff but all reviews, on our thread, seem positive so going for it! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.5.56.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78092,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bdb246152a32892c4ee3f9a9da7b6807","RawContent":"$1600 for equipment and DJ for ceremony and reception including travel from cancun to isla","Attachments":[],"Id":1874200,"PostDate":1412384179,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                $1600 for equipment and DJ for ceremony and reception including travel from cancun to isla\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spj.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.142.197.104","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407336954,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279330.jpg?_r=1407431220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"spjwedding","Id":279330,"Name":"spjwedding","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.104.201.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78092,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"94e729afab17f000bbc1f08373f7c95a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;$1600 for DJ and light up dance floor&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874904,"PostDate":1412850607,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>$1600 for DJ and light up dance floor<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candicecchau@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.104.201.70","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412849001,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280416.png?_r=1412865762","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Candyyy","Id":280416,"Name":"Candyyy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78092,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4261580aab6e6d17a48004081102e9bc","RawContent":"@[member=\"LTR\"] have you found a DJ yet? I&#039;m getting married at Moon Palace too and am in the same boat. I initially thought an iPod dock would be a great alternative but I don&#039;t want to have the hassle of asking a guest to play the songs for us. I want everyone to have a good time and not have to \"work\" during the reception!","Attachments":[],"Id":1880844,"PostDate":1419035279,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279912\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279912-ltr\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">LTR<\/span><\/a> have you found a DJ yet? I'm getting married at Moon Palace too and am in the same boat. I initially thought an iPod dock would be a great alternative but I don't want to have the hassle of asking a guest to play the songs for us. I want everyone to have a good time and not have to \"work\" during the reception!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><br><\/a><br>\u00a0","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410084185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1431039162","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78092","Title":"Average Dj Price For 4-5 Hrs In Cancun","LastPostDate":1419035279},"Pages":{"TotalItems":8,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
