{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":3,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":323,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1880129,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":275926,"Name":"nattiegams325","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275926.jpg?_r=1418313578","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1418298154,"LastPoster":{"Id":275926,"Name":"nattiegams325","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275926.jpg?_r=1418313578","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":45,"Preview":{"Id":1880129,"PostDate":1418298154,"PostContent":"Hey ladies! We're down to 74 days until my big day and we're starting to crack down on choosing s...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"natalie.zaval@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.184.87.109","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1389117352,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275926.jpg?_r=1418313578","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nattiegams325","Id":275926,"Name":"nattiegams325","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.184.85.100","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78468,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8f00189ccf6a190dbb32ffa8f044f16d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey ladies! We&#039;re down to 74 days until my big day and we&#039;re starting to crack down on choosing songs for the ceremony. We are having a guitarist (no iPod) so I have to find songs that translate to the acoustic guitar, which is not as easy as it sounds!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\nDoes anyone have any suggestions or willing to share their playlist if you had a guitarist? Gracias :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880129,"PostDate":1418298154,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey ladies! We're down to 74 days until my big day and we're starting to crack down on choosing songs for the ceremony. We are having a guitarist (no iPod) so I have to find songs that translate to the acoustic guitar, which is not as easy as it sounds!<\/p>\n<p>\nDoes anyone have any suggestions or willing to share their playlist if you had a guitarist? Gracias <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"natalie.zaval@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.184.87.109","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1389117352,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275926.jpg?_r=1418313578","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nattiegams325","Id":275926,"Name":"nattiegams325","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.138.150.9","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78468,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7bd4ff0fb561dbc68da2f7c2e03f10e7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"nattiegams325\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am getting married on February 14th in Cabo and I hired a guitarist for my ceremony and cocktail hour.&amp;nbsp; The guitarist I hired has a website where you can actually listen to songs he plays, so hopefully you can get an idea of how the songs sound when they are played acoustically. His website is www.arturosotomayor.com and the songs I chose are:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Prelude - Ave Maria&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\t&amp;nbsp; Marry Me&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\t&amp;nbsp; A Thousand Years&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\t&amp;nbsp; A Mi Manera&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\t&amp;nbsp; Wonderful tonight&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Processional - Canon in D&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;When I walk down the Isle - Here comes the Bride&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Recessional - I&#039;m Yours&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Prelude - Ave Maria&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\t&amp;nbsp; Marry Me&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\t&amp;nbsp; A Thousand Years&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\t&amp;nbsp; A Mi Manera&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\t&amp;nbsp; Wonderful tonight&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Processional - Canon in D&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;When I walk down the Isle - Here comes the Bride&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Recessional - I&#039;m Yours&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880780,"PostDate":1418929271,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275926\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/275926-nattiegams325\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">nattiegams325<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am getting married on February 14th in Cabo and I hired a guitarist for my ceremony and cocktail hour.\u00a0 The guitarist I hired has a website where you can actually listen to songs he plays, so hopefully you can get an idea of how the songs sound when they are played acoustically. His website is www.arturosotomayor.com and the songs I chose are:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Prelude - Ave Maria<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Marry Me<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 A Thousand Years<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 A Mi Manera<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Wonderful tonight<\/p>\n<p>Processional - Canon in D<\/p>\n<p>When I walk down the Isle - Here comes the Bride<\/p>\n<p>Recessional - I'm Yours<\/p>\n<p>Prelude - Ave Maria<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Marry Me<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 A Thousand Years<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 A Mi Manera<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Wonderful tonight<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Processional - Canon in D<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>When I walk down the Isle - Here comes the Bride<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Recessional - I'm Yours<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michelle_tornay@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.168.63.163","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1405995005,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279117.jpg?_r=1409851926","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MichelleT","Id":279117,"Name":"MichelleT","IsOnline":false}}