{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":3,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":468,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1875594,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":279316,"Name":"ChiTiff","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279316.jpg?_r=1412815301","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1413232312,"LastPoster":{"Id":278203,"Name":"Lizbethc","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278203.jpg?_r=1414267973","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":45,"Preview":{"Id":1875594,"PostDate":1413232312,"PostContent":"Hi Ladies! \u00a0 \u00a0 I'm truly considering using WeddingMix to make a DIY Wedding video, but I was wond...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tiffany.sanders@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.175.163.6","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407267302,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279316.jpg?_r=1412815301","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ChiTiff","Id":279316,"Name":"ChiTiff","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"147.126.81.6","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"36e0cffeabc5eb455e43fed967ad3a59","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(35,38,26);font-family:Georgia, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"&gt;I&#039;m truly considering using WeddingMix to make a DIY Wedding video, but I was wondering if any of you have actually used it. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.storymixmedia.com\/weddingmix\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.storymixmedia.com\/weddingmix\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(35,38,26);font-family:Georgia, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"&gt;I was planning on doing one of the packages with just the app, but I don&#039;t quite see how it&#039;s better than using iMovie + Dropbox or some other online storage option.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(35,38,26);font-family:Georgia, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"&gt;Has anyone ever DIY&#039;d a short wedding video? &amp;nbsp;Any suggestions or ideas for how to do this? &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1875594,"PostDate":1413232312,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(35,38,26);font-family:Georgia, sans-serif;font-size:16px\">I'm truly considering using WeddingMix to make a DIY Wedding video, but I was wondering if any of you have actually used it. <\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.storymixmedia.com\/weddingmix\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.storymixm...com\/weddingmix\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(35,38,26);font-family:Georgia, sans-serif;font-size:16px\">I was planning on doing one of the packages with just the app, but I don't quite see how it's better than using iMovie + Dropbox or some other online storage option.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(35,38,26);font-family:Georgia, sans-serif;font-size:16px\">Has anyone ever DIY'd a short wedding video? \u00a0Any suggestions or ideas for how to do this? \u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tiffany.sanders@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.175.163.6","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407267302,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279316.jpg?_r=1412815301","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ChiTiff","Id":279316,"Name":"ChiTiff","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78214,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by NJBride2014, 14 October 2014 - 11:35 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1413286503,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dfcc30b33337c3ad5d8cc1253b2a64bd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I used WeddingMix for my wedding last month and so far I&#039;m happy I used it. &amp;nbsp;A lot of family and friends participated and we have so many clips of the weekend. &amp;nbsp;We did the app and 3 camera package so we handed out 1 camera to my sister, 1 friend and we kept one. &amp;nbsp;Each person got different parts of the weekend events and wedding which was great. &amp;nbsp;All together I think we have like 300 video clips and so many photos which is cool to look back on. &amp;nbsp;Now I&#039;m in the process of picking my favorite clips so that WeddingMix can make our one hour edited wedding weekend video. &amp;nbsp;It was cool to have video from beginning to end from boarding the plane, going out at night, all wedding events and the honeymoon in one video. &amp;nbsp;I also added some clips of my bachelorette party, diy projects and at home church ceremony. &amp;nbsp;Once I finalize my video (its hard to pick the best clips, LoL) &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ll upload it so you can see the final product. &amp;nbsp;I did also get a professional videographer for the day of the wedding but WeddingMix helped me capture the whole weekend and wedding planning year. &amp;nbsp;Hope this helped, if you have any questions I&#039;m happy to help.&amp;nbsp; :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1875662,"PostDate":1413286404,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I used WeddingMix for my wedding last month and so far I'm happy I used it. \u00a0A lot of family and friends participated and we have so many clips of the weekend. \u00a0We did the app and 3 camera package so we handed out 1 camera to my sister, 1 friend and we kept one. \u00a0Each person got different parts of the weekend events and wedding which was great. \u00a0All together I think we have like 300 video clips and so many photos which is cool to look back on. \u00a0Now I'm in the process of picking my favorite clips so that WeddingMix can make our one hour edited wedding weekend video. \u00a0It was cool to have video from beginning to end from boarding the plane, going out at night, all wedding events and the honeymoon in one video. \u00a0I also added some clips of my bachelorette party, diy projects and at home church ceremony. \u00a0Once I finalize my video (its hard to pick the best clips, LoL) \u00a0I'll upload it so you can see the final product. \u00a0I did also get a professional videographer for the day of the wedding but WeddingMix helped me capture the whole weekend and wedding planning year. \u00a0Hope this helped, if you have any questions I'm happy to help.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<p>43 guests plus bride and groom.... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Engagement Photos - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630<\/a>","Email":"sandyycaza@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1357660461,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264077.jpg?_r=1415048239","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NJBride2014","Id":264077,"Name":"NJBride2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.124.40.102","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"47e3f3d947c887eaed8d7278c60f9a9a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I love iMovie -- use it all the time!! &amp;nbsp;be careful with the dropbox storage though, because it&#039;s hard to get other people&#039;s video (that they recorded with their phones ) onto your computer. I&#039;ve tried to edit together video that was texted to me and it made the video clips way to small and grainy for iMovie :\/&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876902,"PostDate":1414253168,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I love iMovie -- use it all the time!! \u00a0be careful with the dropbox storage though, because it's hard to get other people's video (that they recorded with their phones ) onto your computer. I've tried to edit together video that was texted to me and it made the video clips way to small and grainy for iMovie :\/\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lizbethc1989@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.247.145.179","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1401720488,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278203.jpg?_r=1414267973","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lizbethc","Id":278203,"Name":"Lizbethc","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78214","Title":"Diy Videography Vendors - Weddingmix, Wedit, Etc","LastPostDate":1414253168},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
