p;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:windowtext;\"&gt;http:\/\/www.pctools.com\/free-antivirus&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1323332,"PostDate":1288192132,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I like the labeled disc idea. No money to dole out, no iPod to lose. Sounds perfect.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> ---<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"color:windowtext\">http:\/\/www.pctools.com\/free-antivirus<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"eslocklier@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1287595357,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233368.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Eslocklier","Id":233368,"Name":"Eslocklier","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":4726,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ee67eee1a856757f56a301efc9a1b7f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Be sure to check if your resort stereo uses cd&#039;s or ipods.&amp;nbsp; I know mine(El Dorodo Royale) only has ipod stereos.&amp;nbsp; We asked a close friend to start and stop the playlists for the ceremony and we just faded the songs so it all meshes together.&amp;nbsp; Hopefully it works!&amp;nbsp; My brother did that for his outdoor ceremony in Canada and it worked great!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1323363,"PostDate":1288193375,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Be sure to check if your resort stereo uses cd's or ipods.\u00a0 I know mine(El Dorodo Royale) only has ipod stereos.\u00a0 We asked a close friend to start and stop the playlists for the ceremony and we just faded the songs so it all meshes together.\u00a0 Hopefully it works!\u00a0 My brother did that for his outdoor ceremony in Canada and it worked great!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lindsey_macrae@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"198.161.230.11","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1267568319,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226095.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CanadianLindsey","Id":226095,"Name":"CanadianLindsey","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":4726,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1ad70630ace22556324227aa6e91f2f2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I planned on asking my soon to be brother in law and one of my friends that gets a long well to kind of do it together so they can take breaks or switch on and off.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1340516,"PostDate":1289861361,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I planned on asking my soon to be brother in law and one of my friends that gets a long well to kind of do it together so they can take breaks or switch on and off.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kyndall.ehlert@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268746389,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226491.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kyndall","Id":226491,"Name":"kyndall","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":4726,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"227b6ada2cdfe0ddcb493f5db33f4d21","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I like the idea of asking two people so that they can take breaks if the resort doesn&#039;t supply a person.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1373976,"PostDate":1294755417,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I like the idea of asking two people so that they can take breaks if the resort doesn't supply a person.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shanna0487@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"63.122.89.3","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1294245874,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235127.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shan0487","Id":235127,"Name":"shan0487","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"188.29.166.79","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":4726,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"60b93e4fae51894aac6e316c9f5a028e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We are going to take an ipod with different playlists for different parts of the day&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872968,"PostDate":1411553917,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We are going to take an ipod with different playlists for different parts of the day<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"justineatack@gmail.com","IpAddress":"31.54.1.116","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409997456,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/