rching but mostly dance &amp;amp; slow songs..\n Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":271035,"PostDate":1208440403,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We're thinking jazzy and\/or beachy music for our cocktail hour & dinner...<br \/> Can anyone help with some songs.. tried searching but mostly dance & slow songs..<br \/> Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"meagryan1@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1201802293,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208426.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"happygilmore","Id":208426,"Name":"happygilmore","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14827,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9161a47cd0f42defd384b2b71ec2f08f","RawContent":"There is always Harry Connick or Wynton Marsalis for Jazz stuff. I know Wynton just did an album with Willie Nelson thay is coming out in a few months. And the obvious Jimmy Buffet for beachy music.","Attachments":[],"Id":271047,"PostDate":1208441001,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                There is always Harry Connick or Wynton Marsalis for Jazz stuff. I know Wynton just did an album with Willie Nelson thay is coming out in a few months. And the obvious Jimmy Buffet for beachy music.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i244.photobucket.com\/albums\/gg28\/lucy8144\/DSC_0825.jpg\">http:\/\/i244.photobucket.com\/albums\/g...4\/DSC_0825.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"dakota144@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1198292553,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208052.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":90,"PhotoHeight":90,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lucy106","Id":208052,"Name":"lucy106","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14827,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4d153219388a903c10cea128730d08f0","RawContent":"We are doing the same sort of feel for cocktail and dinner hour. Lets see...\n I downloaded a lot of Michael Buble&#039;s stuff and Van Morrison.\n For beachy feel tons of Kenny Chesney, some Bob Marley, a little Jimmy Buffet.","Attachments":[],"Id":271142,"PostDate":1208445689,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are doing the same sort of feel for cocktail and dinner hour. Lets see...<br \/> I downloaded a lot of Michael Buble's stuff and Van Morrison.<br \/> For beachy feel tons of Kenny Chesney, some Bob Marley, a little Jimmy Buffet.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>My Dreams Cabo Wedding Review<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t22576\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t22576<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"Ryjaxs19@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1159310580,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206835.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jackie","Id":206835,"Name":"Jackie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14827,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"17873bfad731a5decc9d768da7bacfd4","RawContent":"I thought about doing some jazzy type music, but I figured my Cocktail Hour &amp;amp; Reception are on the beach itself so I decided on some fun pop and reggae inspired music for the C-Hour:\n \n 311 (Love Song, Amber)\n UB40 (Every Breath You Take, The Way You Do The Things You Do)\n Bob Marley (Baby I Love Your Way, Is This Love)\n Queen (You&#039;re My Best Friend, Crazy Little Thing Called Love)\n Lauryn Hill (Youre Just To Good To Be True)\n Sade (Color Of Love)\n Cranberries (Love Fool)\n Wayne Wonder (Hold Me Now)\n Ziggy Marley (Drive)\n \n something like that :)","Attachments":[],"Id":271194,"PostDate":1208446921,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I thought about doing some jazzy type music, but I figured my Cocktail Hour & Reception are on the beach itself so I decided on some fun pop and reggae inspired music for the C-Hour:<br \/> <br \/> 311 (Love Song, Amber)<br \/> UB40 (Every Breath You Take, The Way You Do The Things You Do)<br \/> Bob Marley (Baby I Love Your Way, Is This Love)<br \/> Queen (You're My Best Friend, Crazy Little Thing Called Love)<br \/> Lauryn Hill (Youre Just To Good To Be True)<br \/> Sade (Color Of Love)<br \/> Cranberries (Love Fool)<br \/> Wayne Wonder (Hold Me Now)<br \/> Ziggy Marley (Drive)<br \/> <br \/> something like that <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"plumsugar_2000@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1179849089,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207415.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"plumsugar","Id":207415,"Name":"plumsugar","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"C