"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;przyby10&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Are you doing recorded music, or live?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;It will be all downloaded onto our Ipod. WE are going to create different play lists for each part of the wedding day. That way anyone with ipod experience can go over and find what needs to be played.","Attachments":[],"Id":324141,"PostDate":1212338548,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>przyby10<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Are you doing recorded music, or live?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>It will be all downloaded onto our Ipod. WE are going to create different play lists for each part of the wedding day. That way anyone with ipod experience can go over and find what needs to be played.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"meagryan1@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1201802293,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":tru