y {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi OneLove, please do share their info. Thanks in advance =)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lmorency21@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"146.121.23.2","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1275338046,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228718.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lisa203","Id":228718,"Name":"lisa203","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":52319,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f20732b66b63159a39daecf88c8bea2b","RawContent":"Thanks for sharing...would you happen to have their contact\/website info?\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]OneLove420[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n If anyone is interested in having fire dancers as part of entertainment for their wedding. My wedding coordinator told me about Jungle King and its only $200, which would be good entertainment right after dinner or during dinner.\n \n Just thought I&#039;d put that out there.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1323409,"PostDate":1288195253,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;