ue way to entertain guests<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>skadow<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Wish I could get these prices in Cancun\/RM!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarahspencer15@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1281395134,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231199.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"82turtles","Id":231199,"Name":"82turtles","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":52319,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"42bc953f77bb266634213876a704481d","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]yumyum90[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Thats an awesome price! I was quoted $450 by ROR for 3 performances which I guess is a total of 10-15 minutes. I think its worth it though.[\/quote] \n \n \n Wow, I think I will become a fire dancer and move to Jamaica!","Attachments":[],"Id":1335188,"PostDate":1289345835,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>yumyum90<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Thats an awesome price! I was quoted $450 by ROR for 3 performances which I guess is a total of 10-15 minutes. I think its worth it though.<\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> <br \/> Wow, I think I will become a fire dancer and move to Jamaica!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dmkn77@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284683669,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232405.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dmkn77","Id":232405,"Name":"dmkn77","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":52319,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"67e6306219e52ce210212164d45fc392","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; we are doing USD 800 for 20 min. for either 4 or 5 dancers (it keeps changing) so at USD 450 I think thats a steal. I think that 10-15 is great length. We were told at first 6 dancer USD 1,000 for 45 min. but really who wants to watch that for so long? I think it would be super boring.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1335191,"PostDate":1289346077,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> we are doing USD 800 for 20 min. for either 4 or 5 dancers (it keeps changing) so at USD 450 I think thats a steal. I think that 10-15 is great length. We were told at first 6 dancer USD 1,000 for 45 min. but really who wants to watch that for so long? I think it would be super boring.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k_atrisha@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1259430262,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223579.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Boo","Id":223579,"Name":"Boo","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":50,"TotalPages":5,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":40},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
