a;font-size:13px;\"&gt;My fiance and I want an early October wedding, but getting a nice video is VERY important to us because we both majored in film and broadcasting in college :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial, Verdana;font-size:13px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial, Verdana;font-size:13px;\"&gt;I&#039;ve done some research and come across these \"crowdsourced\" wedding video apps called&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.storymixmedia.com\/weddings\/how-it-works-weddingmix-wedding-video.html&#039;&gt;WeddingMix&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.guestshots.com\/&#039;&gt;Guestshots&lt;\/a&gt;. Any experience with these? I think it&#039;s a cool idea (and would be especially convenient for our Ixtapa wedding) but I want a second opinion!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1825340,"PostDate":1389557474,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial, Verdana;font-size:13px\">My fiance and I want an early October wedding, but getting a nice video is VERY important to us because we both majored in film and broadcasting in college <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<div  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial, Verdana;font-size:13px\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial, Verdana;font-size:13px\">I've done some research and come across these \"crowdsourced\" wedding video apps called\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.storymixmedia.com\/weddings\/how-it-works-weddingmix-wedding-video.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>WeddingMix<\/a>\u00a0and\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.guestshots.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Guestshots<\/a>. Any experience with these? I think it's a cool idea (and would be especially convenient for our Ixtapa wedding) but I want a second opinion!\u00a0<\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chawkes@luc.edu","IpAddress":"162.229.106.6","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1387196524,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ThisYearsGirl27","Id":275644,"Name":"ThisYearsGirl27","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.97.112.145","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75968,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b4ef58d46713ddc248220417356537a6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Sounds neat!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m interested to hear any feedback as well!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1832715,"PostDate":1391901015,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Sounds neat!\u00a0 I'm interested to hear any feedback as well!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"meghartman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.97.112.145","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1374432186,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271770.jpg?_r=1391556917","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":159,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"megan224","Id":271770,"Name":"megan224","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.52.225.191","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75968,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4697b723571d89359ddfc5cde97a1c1b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Congratulations on your engagement! &amp;nbsp;Happy Planning! &amp;nbsp;Unfortunately I do not have any tip. &amp;nbsp;I am also looking for advise&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858711,"PostDate":1404868293,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Congratulations on your engagement! \u00a0Happy Planning! \u00a0Unfortunately I do not have any tip. \u00a0I am also looking for advise<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ama