Justin Timberlake\/ Timberland \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Give it to Me\n Ciara \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Get up\n Tweet f\/ Missey Eliot \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Oops Oh My\n Sean Kingston \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Take You There\n Colby O&#039; Donis- What You Got ft Akon\n Pitbull &amp;quot;Go Girl&amp;quot;\n The Anthem feat. Lil Jon\n \n \n It takes Two\n Rob Base\n Atomic Dog\n George Clinton\n More Bounce to the Ounce\n Zapp and Roger\n Brick House\n The Commodores\n Cutie Pie\n One Way\n \n \n MY FORBIDDON lOVER\n \n Round and Round (you got the spinner)\n \n Point of No Return\n Expose\n Can You Feel The Beat\n Lisa Lisa &amp;amp; Cult Jam with Full Force -\n I Wonder If I Take You Home\n Lisa Lisa &amp;amp; The Cult Jam -\n Show me\n Cover Girls\n Spring Love \n Stevie B","Attachments":[],"Id":469282,"PostDate":1222909886,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here are some from my list. we had a dj here pre-mix cd's to play during the band breaks. <br \/> <br \/> Nelly Furtado, Justin Timberlake, \u00e2\u20ac\u201c See us in the Club <br \/> <br \/> P.Diddy and Keisha Cole \u00e2\u20ac\u00a6 Last Night<br \/> <br \/> Timbaland- The Way I Are<br \/> <br \/> Zapp and Roger \u00e2\u20ac\u201c so ruff, so tuff<br \/> One Way \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Cutie Pie<br \/> Lloyd \u00e2\u20ac\u201c You; Get it Shawty<br \/> P.Diddy\/Keisha Cole \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Last Night<br \/> Solja Boy - Crank That<br \/> Danity Kane - Damaged<br \/> Rhianna \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t Stop the Music<br \/> Ne-yo \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Sexy Love; Because of You<br \/> Justin Timberlake - Lovestoned I 