'm Yours<br \/> Shanice - Tender Kisses<br \/> Sizzla - All I Want \/ Jah Love \/ Dry Cry<br \/> Sizzla feat. Rihanna - Give Me A Try (remix)<br \/> Steel Pulse - Your House<br \/> Supercat - Don Dada<br \/> SWV - I'm So Into You \/ Anything<br \/> Tony Toni Tone - Just Me and You \/ Wildchild \/ Lay Your Head On My Pillow<br \/> Troop - I Will Always Love You \/ Spread My Wings<br \/> Will To Power - Baby I Love Your Way<br \/> Zhane - Sending My Love \/ Hey Mr. DJ\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mrsjamyjones@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.201.254.135","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1168256640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207039.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":1000,"PhotoHeight":667,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"starchild","Id":207039,"Name":"starchild","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24606,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8c48a1b8833defa6ab662a48d2a733ab","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;starchild&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Omg I love Lisa Lisa and Cult Jam!! Okay Amy stole some of mine LOL\n \n These are mostly old school and non-explicit &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n 112 - Crazy Over You\n Aaliyah - Rock the Boat\n After 7 - One Night \/ Can&#039;t Stop\n Al B Sure - Night and Day\n Anita Baker - You Bring Me Joy \/ Angel \/ Rapture\n A Tribe Called Quest - Bonita Applebaum \/ Award Tour\n Babyface - Soon As I Get Home\n Babyface feat. Pebbles - Love Makes Things Happen\n Barrington Levy - She&#039;s Mine\n Big Mountain - Baby I Love Your Way\n Biggie, Nelly, Jagged Edge - Nasty Girl\n Biz Markie - Just A Friend\n Black Sheep - The Choice Is Yours\n Blackstreet - Joy\n Bob Marley feat. Lauryn Hill - Turn Your Lights Down Low\n Bobby Brown - Every Little Step I Take, Roni, Good Enough\n Brand New Heavies - Never Stop\n Brian McKnight - Never Felt This Way\n Cameo - Sparkle \/ Candy\n Chaka Khan - Sweet Thing\n Cherelle feat. Alexander O&#039;Neal - Saturday Love\n Chubb Rock - Treat Em Right\n D&#039;Angelo - Higher, When We Get By\n Dazz Band - Whip It\n De La Soul - Saturdays \/ Me, Myself, and I\n Digital Underground - Kiss Me Back \/ Doowhatchalike \/ The Humpty Dance\n DJ Jazzy Jeff &amp;amp; Fresh Prince - Summertime\n DJ Quik feat. Tony Toni Tone - Let&#039;s Get Down\n Donnell Jones - You Know That I Love You \/ Knocks Me Off My Feet\n Dru Hill - Beauty Is Her Name \/ These Are The Times\n El Debarge - I Like It\n En Vogue - Hooked on Your Love\n Eric B. &amp;amp; Rakim - Make Em Clap To This\n EPMD - It&#039;s My Thing\n Fox Brown &amp;amp; Jay-Z - Ain&#039;t No\n Fugees\/Lauryn Hill - Can&#039;t Take My Eyes Off Of You\n George McCrae - I Get Lifted \n Goapele - First Love \/ Closer\n Intro - Ribbon In The Sky\n Jagged Edge - Where&#039;s The Party At \/ Let&#039;s Get Married (remix)\n Janet Jackson - All For You \/ Someone To Call My Lover \/ When I Think of You\n Jodeci - Get on Up \/ Come And Talk To Me \/ Love U For Life\n Johnny Gill - Fairweather Friend \/ My My My\n Jon B. - They Don&#039;t Know\n Kwame and a New Beginning - Only You\n Lauryn Hill feat. D&#039;Angelo - Nothing Even Matters\n Lisa Lisa &amp;amp; Cult Jam - Head To Toe\n LL Cool J - I Need Love \/ Around the Way Girl\n Mariah Carey - Underneath The Stars \/ Emotions \n Mary J. Blige - Love No Limit \/ Real Love\n Michael Jackson - Off The Wall \/ Rock With You \/ Baby Be Mine\n Naughty By Nature - Jamboree \/ OPP\n New Edition - If It Isn&#039;t Love \/ Candy Girl\n Prince - Kiss \/ I Wanna Be Your Lover\n R. Kelly - Happy People \/ Seems Like You&#039;re Ready \/ Bump &amp;amp; Grind\n Run DMC feat. Aerosmith - Walk This Way\n Robin Thicke - Lost Without U\n Sade - Lover&#039;s Rock \/ By Your Side \/ Paradise\n Sean Paul - I&#039;m Still In Love \/ Hot Sexy Punkie\n Shabba Ranks - Mr. Loverman \/ Flex \/ Slow and Sexy\n Shai - Baby I&#039;m Yours\n Shanice - Tender Kisses\n Sizzla - All I Want \/ Jah Love \/ Dry Cry\n Sizzla feat. Rihanna - Give Me A Try (remix)\n Steel Pulse - Your House\n Supercat - Don Dada\n SWV - I&#039;m So Into You \/ Anything\n Tony Toni Tone - Just Me and You \/ Wildchild \/ Lay Your Head On My Pillow\n Troop - I Will Always Love You \/ Spread My Wings\n Will To Power - Baby I Love Your Way\n Zhane - Sending My Love \/ Hey Mr. DJ&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Girl! You just saved me life! The only thing I have left to do before my wedding is to make a list of dance songs....I had no idea how to start! Your list alone not only took me back but I will have my list complete in no time!\n \n You took it back to SWV!!! HA!","Attachments":[],"Id":473036,"PostDate":1223261936,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>starchild<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Omg I love Lisa Lisa and Cult Jam!! Okay Amy stole some of mine LOL<br \/> <br \/> These are mostly old school and non-explicit <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> 112 - Crazy Over You<br \/> Aaliyah - Rock the Boat<br \/> After 7 - One Night \/ Can't Stop<br \/> Al B Sure - Night and Day<br \/> Anita Baker - You Bring Me Joy \/ Angel \/ Rapture<br \/> A Tribe Called Quest - Bonita Applebaum \/ Award Tour<br \/> Babyface - Soon As I Get Home<br \/> Babyface feat. Pebbles - Love Makes Things Happen<br \/> Barrington Levy - She's Mine<br \/> Big Mountain - Baby I Love Your Way<br \/> Biggie, Nelly, Jagged Edge - Nasty Girl<br \/> Biz Markie - Just A Friend<br \/> Black Sheep - The Choice Is Yours<br \/> Blackstreet - Joy<br \/> Bob Marley feat. Lauryn Hill - Turn Your Lights Down Low<br \/> Bobby Brown - Every Little Step I Take, Roni, Good Enough<br \/> Brand New Heavies - Never Stop<br \/> Brian McKnight - Never Felt This Way<br \/> Cameo - Sparkle \/ Candy<br \/> Chaka Khan - Sweet Thing<br \/> Cherelle feat. Alexander O'Neal - Saturday Love<br \/> Chubb Rock - Treat Em Right<br \/> D'Angelo - Higher, When We Get By<br \/> Dazz Band - Whip It<br \/> De La Soul - Saturdays \/ Me, Myself, and I<br \/> Digital Underground - Kiss Me Back \/ Doowhatchalike \/ The Humpty Dance<br \/> DJ Jazzy Jeff & Fresh Prince - Summertime<br \/> DJ Quik feat. Tony Toni Tone - Let's Get Down<br \/> Donnell Jones - You Know That I Love You \/ Knocks Me Off My Feet<br \/> Dru Hill - Beauty Is Her Name \/ These Are The Times<br \/> El Debarge - I Like It<br \/> En Vogue - Hooked on Your Love<br \/> Eric B. & Rakim - Make Em Clap To This<br \/> EPMD - It's My Thing<br \/> Fox Brown & Jay-Z - Ain't No<br \/> Fugees\/Lauryn Hill - Can't Take My Eyes Off Of You<br \/> George McCrae - I Get Lifted <br \/> Goapele - First Love \/ Closer<br \/> Intro - Ribbon In The Sky<br \/> Jagged Edge - Where's The Party At \/ Let's Get Married (remix)<br \/> Janet Jackson - All For You \/ Someone To Call My Lover \/ When I Think of You<br \/> Jodeci - Get on Up \/ Come And Talk To Me \/ Love U For Life<br \/> Johnny Gill - Fairweather Friend \/ My My My<br \/> Jon B. - They Don't Know<br \/> Kwame and a New Beginning - Only You<br \/> Lauryn Hill feat. D'Angelo - Nothing Even Matters<br \/> Lisa Lisa & Cult Jam - Head To Toe<br \/> LL Cool J - I Need Love \/ Around the Way Girl<br \/> Mariah Carey - Underneath The Stars \/ Emotions <br \/> Mary J. Blige - Love No Limit \/ Real Love<br \/> Michael Jackson - Off The Wall \/ Rock With You \/ Baby Be Mine<br \/> Naughty By Nature - Jamboree \/ OPP<br \/> New Edition - If It Isn't Love \/ Candy Girl<br \/> Prince - Kiss \/ I Wanna Be Your Lover<br \/> R. Kelly - Happy People \/ Seems Like You're Ready \/ Bump & Grind<br \/> Run DMC feat. Aerosmith - Walk This Way<br \/> Robin Thicke - Lost Without U<br \/> Sade - Lover's Rock \/ By Your Side \/ Paradise<br \/> Sean Paul - I'm Still In Love \/ Hot Sexy Punkie<br \/> Shabba Ranks - Mr. Loverman \/ Flex \/ Slow and Sexy<br \/> Shai - Baby I'm Yours<br \/> Shanice - Tender Kisses<br \/> Sizzla - All I Want \/ Jah Love \/ Dry Cry<br \/> Sizzla feat. Rihanna - Give Me A Try (remix)<br \/> Steel Pulse - Your House<br \/> Supercat - Don Dada<br \/> SWV - I'm So Into You \/ Anything<br \/> Tony Toni Tone - Just Me and You \/ Wildchild \/ Lay Your Head On My Pillow<br \/> Troop - I Will Always Love You \/ Spread My Wings<br \/> Will To Power - Baby I Love Your Way<br \/> Zhane - Sending My Love \/ Hey Mr. DJ<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Girl! You just saved me life! The only thing I have left to do before my wedding is to make a list of dance songs....I had no idea how to start! Your list alone not only took me back but I will have my list complete in no time!<br \/> <br \/> You took it back to SWV!!! HA!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Carina<\/span><br><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;80\/st\/20081027\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/c2a9\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...c2a9\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"carinacendejas@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1217452603,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210886.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":68,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cendcar","Id":210886,"Name":"cendcar","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24606,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73e9ad35a2b04ec720e2f373909277ef","RawContent":"This was great---thanks for the input.","Attachments":[],"Id":473296,"PostDate":1223303715,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n           