{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24606,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2e29f78d6b9719f23cb570ea6c263ce6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; These are great playlists!!!&amp;nbsp; I swear, if I had the chance to play all 90s music at my wedding I probably would&amp;nbsp; &lt;span alt=\":smile29:\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1364669118035_1516\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\"&gt;&lt;img id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1364669118035_1515\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1740300,"PostDate":1364654850,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> These are great playlists!!!\u00a0 I swear, if I had the chance to play all 90s music at my wedding I probably would\u00a0 <span alt=\":smile29:\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1364669118035_1516\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1364669118035_1515\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"BethS.RN007@gmail.com","IpAddress":"134.174.21.190","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361570583,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266460.jpg?_r=1395588404","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"UMassRN007","Id":266460,"Name":"UMassRN007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24606,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"526a0c2a07f91dfcf1b51c0b449c06ae","RawContent":"[quote name=\"UMassRN007\"]\nThese are great playlists!!!  I swear, if I had the chance to play all 90s music at my wedding I probably would  :smile29:[\/quote]I am the same way!","Attachments":[],"Id":1741028,"PostDate":1364855431,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"UMassRN007\" url=\"\/t\/30039\/r&#045;b&#045;hip&#045;hop&#045;old&#045;skool&#045;wedding&#045;music#post_1889869\"><p>These are great playlists!!!\u00a0 I swear, if I had the chance to play all 90s music at my wedding I probably would\u00a0 :smile29:<\/p><\/blockquote>I am the same way!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joeyandnadine@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.245.25.159","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1338760582,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256215.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsWWhite","Id":256215,"Name":"MrsWWhite","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24606,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"16b45f97e084b059d38aa9f357d09117","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Why not do mash ups? I think it would be great! &lt;span alt=\":rockon:\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1366935782102_1451\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rockon.gif\"&gt;&lt;img id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1366935782102_1450\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rockon.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also, wanted to ask what do you think about getting &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/earcandylive.co.uk\/party-bands\"&gt;party bands&lt;\/a&gt; to play to play during your wedding day? Professionals are good but it&#039;s pricey; I am thinking about getting a friend with a band I know but I am having second thoughts as I think he should be partying with us and not there to play music only.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1750929,"PostDate":1366921798,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Why not do mash ups? I think it would be great! <span alt=\":rockon:\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1366935782102_1451\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rockon.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1366935782102_1450\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rockon.gif\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also, wanted to ask what do you think about getting <a href='http:\/\/earcandylive.co.uk\/party-bands' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>party bands<\/a> to play to play during your wedding day? Professionals are good but it's pricey; I am thinking about getting a friend with a band I know but I am having second thoughts as I think he should be partying with us and not there to play music only.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"earcandymusic43@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1366920671,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268985.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"EarCandyMusic","Id":268985,"Name":"EarCandyMusic","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24606,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"51ff49a8ff0e60b25e97d71049c17629","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m going to steal this list ... I have some already in my head but this will get my juices flowing. &amp;nbsp;I loooooove music,&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1770807,"PostDate":1371750990,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n      