Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":2,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":208,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1858310,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":277733,"Name":"BusyBee280","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277733.jpg?_r=1400873765","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":213,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1404573270,"LastPoster":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":45,"Preview":{"Id":1858310,"PostDate":1404573270,"PostContent":"So since the beginning of my wedding planning process, I have been trying to make sure that my FI...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amanda.hodges1@snhu.edu","IpAddress":"24.62.217.165","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398523937,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277733.jpg?_r=1400873765","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":213,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BusyBee280","Id":277733,"Name":"BusyBee280","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.62.217.165","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77476,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dd1a9f940331b89473b0e5017aee2fb1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So since the beginning of my wedding planning process, I have been trying to make sure that my FI gets his word in on stuff that he wants out of it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As we were making our selections on what form of music, he said that he would love a saxophone player, so I went along and sent the request to my coordinator.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My FI hasn&#039;t had the time to pick which music he wants, and its time to put in our requests to make sure the player knows all of the songs.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve been listening to saxophone music on Pandora, but have NO CLUE what would be good for our wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It will be incredibly laid back, family only and there won&#039;t be any dancing or anything of that sort. Anyone have any suggestions for decent sax songs that might suite a wedding?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858310,"PostDate":1404573270,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So since the beginning of my wedding planning process, I have been trying to make sure that my FI gets his word in on stuff that he wants out of it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As we were making our selections on what form of music, he said that he would love a saxophone player, so I went along and sent the request to my coordinator.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My FI hasn't had the time to pick which music he wants, and its time to put in our requests to make sure the player knows all of the songs.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've been listening to saxophone music on Pandora, but have NO CLUE what would be good for our wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It will be incredibly laid back, family only and there won't be any dancing or anything of that sort. Anyone have any suggestions for decent sax songs that might suite a wedding?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amanda.hodges1@snhu.edu","IpAddress":"24.62.217.165","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398523937,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277733.jpg?_r=1400873765","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":213,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BusyBee280","Id":277733,"Name":"BusyBee280","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.14.134","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77476,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6d86f8a3df65fa37e9ab86d3dada4eff","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow that&#039;s a tough one. Can&#039;t say that I&#039;m a sax fan at all so I can&#039;t be of any help. Good luck though. I would think maybe you would have to find out if you want more of a jaz feel, or just modern.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m sure there is someone here that will have some tips!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858331,"PostDate":1404598542,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow that's a tough one. Can't say that I'm a sax fan at all so I can't be of any help. Good luck though. I would think maybe you would have to find out if you want more of a jaz feel, or just modern.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm sure there is someone here that will have some tips!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77476","Title":"The Fi Chose A Sax Player Help!","LastPostDate":1404598542},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
