mbership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137209820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":314,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ad83802b64ff81d7b0fc7a6a49a9738a","RawContent":"I don&#039;t just mean the first dance song and father\/daughter dance but also the ones that make you want to&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bootyshake.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bootyshake\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; !!\n \n i want to know what songs it takes to get your guests &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rockon.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Rockon\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; OUT!\n \n this is what i had...some of them are cheesy but fun.\n \n &lt;strong&gt;cockatail hour\/ dinner:&lt;\/strong&gt;\n \n margaritaville - jimmy buffet\n don&#039;t stop believe - journey\n just like heaven - the cure\n I Left My Heart In San Francisco - Bennett\n summer of 69 - bryan adams\n lights - journey\n Sea Of Love - Honey Drippers\n Faithfully - Journey\n The Joker - Steve Miller\n Melt With You - Modern English\n Tainted Love - Soft Cell\n time after time - cindy lauper\n already gone - eagles\n jack and diane - john cougar mellencamp\n ring of fire - johnny cash\n Jack Johnson\n * Michael Buble\n \n &lt;strong&gt;First dance: &lt;\/strong&gt;Heaven - bryan adams ..\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Parents Dance:&lt;\/strong&gt; the way you look tonight (please call out the bride and her father , then the groom and his mother. Have them dance for 2-3 minutes then call out brides mother to dance with brides father and grooms father to dance with grooms mother \n \n garter toss: another one bites the dust - Queen (on IPOD)\n bouquet: this ones for the girls - Marina McBride (on IPOD)\n \n &lt;strong&gt;slow dance:&lt;\/strong&gt;\n \n what a wonderful word - lousi armstrong (dance with parents)\n can&#039;t help falling in love - elvis\n the way you look tonight - frank sinatra\n brown eyed girl - van morrison\n everything i do - bryan adams\n Crazy - Patsy Cline\n heaven - bryan adams (first dance)\n True color - cindy lauper\n i want to know what love it - journey\n unforgettable - natalie &amp;amp; nat king cole\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Dance:&lt;\/strong&gt;\n \n Crazy in love - Beyone\n Pour some sugar on me - def leppard\n YMCA\n check on it - Beyonce\n You shook me all night long - AC\/DC\n come on eileen - dexy&#039;s midnight runners\n our house - talking heads\n electric avenue - eddie grant\n shout - otis day, isley brothers\n living on a prayer - bon jovi\n milkshake - kelis\n mambo #5 - lou vega\n blister in the sun - violent femmes\n i like it like that - blackout allstars\n get the party started -pink\n get down tonight - kc and the sunshine band\n livin on a prayer - bon jovi\n i love rock and roll - joan jett\n mony mony - billy idol\n we are family - sister sledge\n ladies night - kool and the gang\n hot hot hot - buster poindexter \/ arrow\n pump it up - joe budden\n party up (up in here) - DMX\n Turn The Beat Around - Gloria Estefan\n rock your body - justin timberlake\n can&#039;t get you out of my head - kylie minogue\n rock and roll all night - kiss\n Finally - Ce Ce Peniston\n I&#039;m Too Sexy - Right Said Fred\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Hip\/Hop Dance List:&lt;\/strong&gt; phase into some hip-hop later in the night as older folks leave or get drunk &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n In Da CLub - 50 cent\n Yeah - Usher w\/ludacris\n Get low - Lil jon\n Hot in heurre - nelly\n ride wit me- nelly\n back that thing up - juvenile\n holiday in - chingy\n Rump Shaker - Wrecks N Effect","Attachments":[],"Id":1880,"PostDate":1159507902,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I don't just mean the first dance song and father\/daughter dance but also the ones that make you want to<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bootyshake.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bootyshake\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> !!<br \/> <br \/> i want to know what songs it takes to get your guests <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rockon.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Rockon\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> OUT!<br \/> <br \/> this is what i had...some of them are cheesy but fun.<br \/> <br \/> <strong>cockatail hour\/ dinner:<\/strong><br \/> <br \/> margaritaville - jimmy buffet<br \/> don't stop believe - journey<br \/> just like heaven - the cure<br \/> I Left My Heart In San Francisco - Bennett<br \/> summer of 69 - bryan adams<br \/> lights - journey<br \/> Sea Of Love - Honey Drippers<br \/> Faithfully - Journey<br \/> The Joker - Steve Miller<br \/> Melt With You - Modern English<br \/> Tainted Love - Soft Cell<br \/> time after time - cindy lauper<br \/> already gone - eagles<br \/> jack and diane - john cougar mellencamp<br \/> ring of fire - johnny cash<br \/> Jack Johnson<br \/> * Michael Buble<br \/> <br \/> <strong>First dance: <\/strong>Heaven - bryan adams ..<br \/> <br \/> <strong>Parents Dance:<\/strong> the way you look tonight (please call out the bride and her father , then the groom and his mother. Have them dance for 2-3 minutes then call out brides mother to dance with brides father and grooms father to dance with grooms mother <br \/> <br \/> garter toss: another one bites the dust - Queen (on IPOD)<br \/> bouquet: this ones for the girls - Marina McBride (on IPOD)<br \/> <br \/> <strong>slow dance:<\/strong><br \/> <br \/> what a wonderful word - lousi armstrong (dance with parents)<br \/> can't help falling in love - elvis<br \/> the way you look tonight - frank sinatra<br \/> brown eyed girl - van morrison<br \/> everything i do - bryan adams<br \/> Crazy - Patsy Cline<br \/> heaven - bryan adams (first dance)<br \/> True color - cindy lauper<br \/> i want to know what love it - journey<br \/> unforgettable - natalie & nat king cole<br \/> <br \/> <strong>Dance:<\/strong><br \/> <br \/> Crazy in love - Beyone<br \/> Pour some sugar on me - def leppard<br \/> YMCA<br \/> check on it - Beyonce<br \/> You shook me all night long - AC\/DC<br \/> come on eileen - dexy's midnight runners<br \/> our house - talking heads<br \/> electric avenue - eddie grant<br \/> shout - otis day, isley brothers<br \/> living on a prayer - bon jovi<br \/> milkshake - kelis<br \/> mambo #5 - lou vega<br \/> blister in the sun - violent femmes<br \/> 