ing=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;host&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;yes, old people will think we are really dancing to a song about milksahes and they will be cool with that &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cheesy\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Okay, it took me a while to stop laughing. But you&#039;re right, my mother would totally think it was a song about milkshakes!! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/jiggy.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Jiggy\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906,"PostDate":1159553312,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>host<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">yes, old people will think we are really dancing to a song about milksahes and they will be cool with that <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cheesy\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Okay, it took me a while to stop laughing. But you're right, my mother would totally think it was a song about milkshakes!! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/jiggy.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Jiggy\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karlaroldan@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1153925280,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206766.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":56,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KARLA","Id":206766,"Name":"KARLA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":314,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9a410b6449ce42eb40af84a2e9240d9c","RawContent":"Here&#039;s my list. For the most part, I deleted duplicates that Tammy already listed since she had so many great ones. I used to be into salsa dancing (and also lived in Spain for a while) so there&#039;s lots of songs in Spanish on my list. Even if you can&#039;t understand the words (like my FI), it can add a fun flavor to the reception.\n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Mariachi Songs&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Cielito Lindo&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Guadalajara&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Guantanamera&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;La Bamba&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;La Cucaracha&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Las Mananitas&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;&lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;MariaElena&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;First Dance (Bride &amp;amp; Groom) &lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n &lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;&lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;Eva Cassidy - You Take My Breath Away&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Father Daughter Dance&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Heartland - I Loved Her First&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Josh Groban - You Raise Me Up&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;&lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;Martina McBride - In My Daughter&#039;s Eyes&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Cocktail Hour \/ Dinner&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Adam Sandler - I&#039;ll Grow Old With You&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Barry White - Can&#039;t Get Enough Of Your Love Babe&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Bob Marley - Is This Love?&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Dean Martin - Ain&#039;t That a Kick in the Head&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Diana Krall - Besame Mucho&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Diana Krall - The Look of Love&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Dixie Chicks - I&#039;ll Take Care of You&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Dixie Cups - Chapel of Love&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Enrique Iglesias - Hero&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Eric Clapton - Wonderful Tonight&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Eva Cassidy - I Know You By Heart&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Eva Cassidy - Songbird&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Garth Brooks - Two Pina Coladas&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;George Strait - I Cross My Heart&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Harry Belafonte - Day-O (Banana Boat Song)&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Harry Belafonte - Jump the Line&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Jack Johnson - Upside Down&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Jimmy Soul - If You Wanna Be Happy&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Kasey Chambers - This Flower&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Lauryn Hill - Can&#039;t Take My Eyes Off You&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Los Lobos with Antonio Banderas - El Mariachi (from Desperado)&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Martina McBride - Wearing White&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Michael Buble - I&#039;ve Got You Under My Skin&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Michael Buble - Quando, Quando, Quando&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Paul Simon - Father &amp;amp; Daughter&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Phil Collins - You&#039;ll Be In My Heart&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Rod Stewart - Forever Young&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Sade - By Your Side&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Sara Evans - I Could Not Ask For More&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Sergio Mendes - Magalenha&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Temptations - Just My Imagination&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;The Crystals - Then He Kissed Me&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Tracy Chapman - Fast Car&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;UB40 - Red Wine&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Cocktail Hour \/ Dinner - Spanish&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Alejandro Sanz - Corazon Partio&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Buena Vista Social Club - Candela&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Carlos Vives - Tu Amor Eterno&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Gipsy Kings - A Tu Vera&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Gipsy Kings - Baila Me&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Gipsy Kings - Un Amor&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Gloria Estefan - Mi Tierra&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Grupo Fantasma - Laredo&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Juanes - A Dios Le Pido&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Juanes - Para Tu Amor&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Los Lobos - La Bamba&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Mana - Oye Mi Amor&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Man\u00a1 (MTV Unplugged) - En El Muelle de San Blas&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Proyecto Uno - Tiburon (Spanish)&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;&lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;Wyclef Jean &#8211; Guantanamera&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Cake Cutting&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Def Leopard - Pour Some Sugar On Me&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font face=\"Times New Roman