e Quedan&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Fast Dances&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Chubby Checker - Let&#039;s Twist Again&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Four Seasons - O What A Night (September 1963)&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Gloria Estefan - Conga&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;John Travolta - Grease Megamix&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Justin Timberlake - Sexyback&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Prince - Kiss&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Run DMC - Walk This Way&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Sufaris - Wipe Out&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;The Champs - Tequila&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;The Kinks - You Really Got Me&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Tone Loc - Wild Thing&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Vanilla Ice - Ice Ice Baby&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Venga Boyz - We Like to Party&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Wild Cherry - Play That Funky Music&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Will Smith - Getting&#039; Jiggy With It&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Will Smith - Miami&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Fast Dances &#8211; Spanish&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Buena Vista Social Club - El Cuarto de Tula&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Carlos Vives - Fruta Fresca&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Celia Cruz - La Vida es Un Carnaval&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Chayanne - Saolme&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Elvis Crespo - Princesita&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Elvis Crespo - Suavemente&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Elvis Crespo - Tu Sonrisa&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Gipsy Kings - Medley: Bamboleo, Volare, Djobi Djoba, Pida Me La, Baila Me&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Gloria Estefan - Oye (Spanish)&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Mach &amp;amp; Daddy La - Botella&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Man\u00a1 - Se Me Olvido Otra Vez&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Ricky Martin - Copa de La Vida (Cup of Life)&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Ricky Martin - Maria&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Ricky Martin - Por Arriba, Por Abajo&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Shakira - Ciega Sordomuda&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Shakira - La Tortura&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;Shakira - Ojos Asi&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913,"PostDate":1159555359,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here's my list. For the most part, I deleted duplicates that Tammy already listed since she had so many great ones. I used to be into salsa dancing (and also lived in Spain for a while) so there's lots of songs in Spanish on my list. Even if you can't understand the words (like my FI), it can add a fun flavor to the reception.<br \/> <br \/> <strong><u><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Mariachi Songs<\/font><\/font><\/u><\/strong><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Cielito Lindo<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Guadalajara<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Guantanamera<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">La Bamba<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">La Cucaracha<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Las Mananitas<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font face=\"Times New Roman\"><font size=\"3\">MariaElena<\/font><\/font><br \/> <br \/> <strong><u><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">First Dance (Bride & Groom) <\/font><\/font><\/u><\/strong><br \/> <font face=\"Times New Roman\"><font size=\"3\">Eva Cassidy - You Take My Breath Away<\/font><\/font><br \/> <br \/> <strong><u><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Father Daughter Dance<\/font><\/font><\/u><\/strong><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Heartland - I Loved Her First<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Josh Groban - You Raise Me Up<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font face=\"Times New Roman\"><font size=\"3\">Martina McBride - In My Daughter's Eyes<\/font><\/font><br \/> <br \/> <strong><u><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Cocktail Hour \/ Dinner<\/font><\/font><\/u><\/strong><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Adam Sandler - I'll Grow Old With You<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Barry White - Can't Get Enough Of Your Love Babe<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Bob Marley - Is This Love?<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Dean Martin - Ain't That a Kick in the Head<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Diana Krall - Besame Mucho<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Diana Krall - The Look of Love<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Dixie Chicks - I'll Take Care of You<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Dixie Cups - Chapel of Love<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Enrique Iglesias - Hero<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Eric Clapton - Wonderful Tonight<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Eva Cassidy - I Know You By Heart<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Eva Cassidy - Songbird<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Garth Brooks - Two Pina Coladas<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">George Strait - I Cross My Heart<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Harry Belafonte - Day-O (Banana Boat Song)<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Harry Belafonte - Jump the Line<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Jack Johnson - Upside Down<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Jimmy Soul - If You Wanna Be Happy<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Kasey Chambers - This Flower<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Lauryn Hill - Can't Take My Eyes Off You<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Los Lobos with Antonio Banderas - El Mariachi (from Desperado)<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Martina McBride - Wearing White<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Michael Buble - I've Got You Under My Skin<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Michael Buble - Quando, Quando, Quando<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Paul Simon - Father & Daughter<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Phil Collins - You'll Be In My Heart<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Rod Stewart - Forever Young<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Sade - By Your Side<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Sara Evans - I Could Not Ask For More<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Sergio Mendes - Magalenha<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Temptations - Just My Imagination<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">The Crystals - Then He Kissed Me<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Tracy Chapman - Fast Car<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">UB40 - Red Wine<\/font><\/font><br \/> <br \/> <strong><u><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Cocktail Hour \/ Dinner - Spanish<\/font><\/font><\/u><\/strong><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Alejandro Sanz - Corazon Partio<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Buena Vista Social Club - Candela<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Carlos Vives - Tu Amor Eterno<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Gipsy Kings - A Tu Vera<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Gipsy Kings - Baila Me<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Gipsy Kings - Un Amor<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Gloria Estefan - Mi Tierra<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Grupo Fantasma - Laredo<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Juanes - A Dios Le Pido<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Juanes - Para Tu Amor<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Los Lobos - La Bamba<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Mana - Oye Mi Amor<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Man\u00a1 (MTV Unplugged) - En El Muelle de San Blas<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Proyecto Uno - Tiburon (Spanish)<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font face=\"Times New Roman\"><font size=\"3\">Wyclef Jean &#8211; Guantanamera<\/font><\/font><br \/> <br \/> <strong><u><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Cake Cutting<\/font><\/font><\/u><\/strong><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"