s Twist Again<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Four Seasons - O What A Night (September 1963)<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Gloria Estefan - Conga<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">John Travolta - Grease Megamix<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Justin Timberlake - Sexyback<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Prince - Kiss<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Run DMC - Walk This Way<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Sufaris - Wipe Out<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">The Champs - Tequila<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">The Kinks - You Really Got Me<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Tone Loc - Wild Thing<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Vanilla Ice - Ice Ice Baby<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Venga Boyz - We Like to Party<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Wild Cherry - Play That Funky Music<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Will Smith - Getting' Jiggy With It<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Will Smith - Miami<\/font><\/font><br \/> <br \/> <strong><u><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Fast Dances &#8211; Spanish<\/font><\/font><\/u><\/strong><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Buena Vista Social Club - El Cuarto de Tula<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Carlos Vives - Fruta Fresca<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Celia Cruz - La Vida es Un Carnaval<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Chayanne - Saolme<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Elvis Crespo - Princesita<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Elvis Crespo - Suavemente<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Elvis Crespo - Tu Sonrisa<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Gipsy Kings - Medley: Bamboleo, Volare, Djobi Djoba, Pida Me La, Baila Me<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Gloria Estefan - Oye (Spanish)<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Mach & Daddy La - Botella<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Man\u00a1 - Se Me Olvido Otra Vez<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Ricky Martin - Copa de La Vida (Cup of Life)<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Ricky Martin - Maria<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Ricky Martin - Por Arriba, Por Abajo<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Shakira - Ciega Sordomuda<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Shakira - La Tortura<\/font><\/font><br \/> <font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Shakira - Ojos Asi<\/font><\/font>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>MariaElena - 10\/28\/06<br>Hilton \/ San Jose Catholic Church<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"murillo_me@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1149702000,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206744.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":44,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MARIAELM","Id":206744,"Name":"MARIAELM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":314,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"78215970477d7220ae793060a1af53e7","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;KARLA&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Okay, it took me a while to stop laughing. But you&#039;re right, my mother would totally think it was a song about milkshakes!! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/jiggy.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Jiggy\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;so funny, my mom would think the same thing!","Attachments":[],"Id":1914,"PostDate":1159555390,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>KARLA<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Okay, it took me a while to stop laughing. But you're right, my mother would totally think it was a song about milkshakes!! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/jiggy.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Jiggy\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>so funny, my mom would think the same thing!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>MariaElena - 10\/28\/06<br>Hilton \/ San Jose Catholic Church<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"murillo_me@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1149702000,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206744.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":44,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MARIAELM","Id":206744,"Name":"MARIAELM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":314,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1492ea5b794fa5ac49f0ff1151b39613","RawContent":"Great song list MariaElena! I love Diana Krall - she&#039;s definitely going to be part of our dinner music.","Attachments":[],"Id":1919,"PostDate":1159557150,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Great song list MariaElena! I love Diana Krall - she's definitely going to be part of our dinner music.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"clb26@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"67.182.138.230","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1148498640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"A10CalGal","Id":206736,"Name":"A10CalGal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":314,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0645d244409c5afbf77cccb28b344d93","RawContent":"Maria Elena,\n \n Don&#039;t be surprised if my list has many of the same Spanish songs. I was just looking through my iTunes and I have most of those. We have the same taste in Spanish music! I would add off the top of my head: La Bomba - Ricky Martin and a few Juan Luis Guerra songs.\n \n Are you having a DJ?\n \n And which Ojos Asi from Shakira are you playing? The one from the MTV Unplugged is my favorite.","Attachments":[],"Id":1920,"PostDate":1159557272,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Maria Elena,<br \/> <br \/> Don't be surprised if my list has many of the same Spanish songs. I was just looking through my iTunes and I have most of those. We have the same taste in Spanish music! I would add off the top of my head: La Bomba - Ricky Martin and a few Juan Luis Guerra songs.<br \/> <br \/> Are you having a DJ?<br \/> <br \/> And which Ojos Asi from Shakira are you playing? The one from the MTV Unplugged is my favorite.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karlaroldan@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1153925280,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206766.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":56,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KARLA","Id":206766,"Name":"KARLA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":314,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d566fd6fea536486ad0c4f22376e337b","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;A10CALGAL&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Great song list MariaElena! I love Diana Krall - she&#039;s definitely going to be part of our dinner music.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;i&#039;m glad you liked it. i&#039;m obsessed with music. i just bought diana krall&#039;s new cd yesterday (&amp;quot;from this moment on&amp;quot;). i haven&#039;t listened to it enough to know if i want to add any songs to my playlist. i have to many songs as it is!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1921,"PostDate":1159557684,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>A10CALGAL<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Great song list MariaElena! I love Diana Krall - she's definitely going to be part of our dinner music.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>i'm glad you liked it. i'm obsessed with music. i just bought diana krall's new cd yesterday (\"from this moment on\"). i haven't listened to it enough to know if i want to add any songs to my playlist. i have to many songs as it is!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>MariaElena - 10\/28\/06<br>Hilton \/ San Jose Catholic Church<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"murillo_me@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1149702000,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206744.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":44,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MARIAELM","Id":206744,"Name":"MARIAELM","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"314","Title":"Post your \"Must Have\" wedding songs","LastPostDate":1402572092},"Pages":{"TotalItems":370,"TotalPages":37,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":360},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
