Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":314,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1a0d10ddf6626359ed2c95713c66b0ce","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;KARLA&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Maria Elena,\n \n Don&#039;t be surprised if my list has many of the same Spanish songs. I was just looking through my iTunes and I have most of those. We have the same taste in Spanish music! I would add off the top of my head: La Bomba - Ricky Martin and a few Juan Luis Guerra songs.\n \n Are you having a DJ?\n \n And which Ojos Asi from Shakira are you playing? The one from the MTV Unplugged is my favorite.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Ah, a fellow spanish music lover! I forgot Ricky Martin&#039;s La Bomba! I&#039;ll probably play the MTV Unplugged version of Shakira&#039;s &amp;quot;Ojos Asi&amp;quot;. I just saw her in concert over the weekend and am obsessed with everything Shakira (old stuff) again. Yes, we&#039;re having a DJ. His name is Raul from AVL systems. I&#039;m trying to coordinate with David Flores from AVL, but he&#039;s been very unresponsive. I&#039;m starting to get scared he won&#039;t show up for my wedding. We haven&#039;t even gone over my song list yet - so annoying!","Attachments":[],"Id":1922,"PostDate":1159557988,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>KARLA<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Maria Elena,<br \/> <br \/> Don't be surprised if my list has many of the same Spanish songs. I was just looking through my iTunes and I have most of those. We have the same taste in Spanish music! I would add off the top of my head: La Bomba - Ricky Martin and a few Juan Luis Guerra songs.<br \/> <br \/> Are you having a DJ?<br \/> <br \/> And which Ojos Asi from Shakira are you playing? The one from the MTV Unplugged is my favorite.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Ah, a fellow spanish music lover! I forgot Ricky Martin's La Bomba! I'll probably play the MTV Unplugged version of Shakira's \"Ojos Asi\". I just saw her in concert over the weekend and am obsessed with everything Shakira (old stuff) again. Yes, we're having a DJ. His name is Raul from AVL systems. I'm trying to coordinate with David Flores from AVL, but he's been very unresponsive. I'm starting to get scared he won't show up for my wedding. We haven't even gone over my song list yet - so annoying!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>MariaElena - 10\/28\/06<br>Hilton \/ San Jose Catholic Church<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"murillo_me@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1149702000,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206744.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":44,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MARIAELM","Id":206744,"Name":"MARIAELM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":314,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8946c829761ff1886d45eb128779f6e3","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;MARIAELM&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Ah, a fellow spanish music lover! I forgot Ricky Martin&#039;s La Bomba! I&#039;ll probably play the MTV Unplugged version of Shakira&#039;s &amp;quot;Ojos Asi&amp;quot;. I just saw her in concert over the weekend and am obsessed with everything Shakira (old stuff) again. Yes, we&#039;re having a DJ. His name is Raul from AVL systems. I&#039;m trying to coordinate with David Flores from AVL, but he&#039;s been very unresponsive. I&#039;m starting to get scared he won&#039;t show up for my wedding. We haven&#039;t even gone over my song list yet - so annoying!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Yeah, I&#039;m sure you&#039;re just eager to cross that off your list! The only songs I&#039;m worried the DJ won&#039;t have is the Country songs my FI picked out. I&#039;m sure they have all those Spanish music though! I am debating as to how much Spanish pop songs to include... I think I may add more Salsa. 8 of us are all taking weekly Salsa lessons to be able to shake it out on the dance floor. It&#039;s cute to see everybody excited about dancing Salsa at the wedding. I have the DJ Adan Mijares... I just got his name this past weekend from the coordinator. I haven&#039;t heard anything about him. I have a feeling all the DJs down there are about the same.","Attachments":[],"Id":1991,"PostDate":1159709987,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>MARIAELM<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Ah, a fellow spanish music lover! I forgot Ricky Martin's La Bomba! I'll probably play the MTV Unplugged version of Shakira's \"Ojos Asi\". I just saw her in concert over the weekend and am obsessed with everything Shakira (old stuff) again. Yes, we're having a DJ. His name is Raul from AVL systems. I'm trying to coordinate with David Flores from AVL, but he's been very unresponsive. I'm starting to get scared he won't show up for my wedding. We haven't even gone over my song list yet - so annoying!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Yeah, I'm sure you're just eager to cross that off your list! The only songs I'm worried the DJ won't have is the Country songs my FI picked out. I'm sure they have all those Spanish music though! I am debating as to how much Spanish pop songs to include... I think I may add more Salsa. 8 of us are all taking weekly Salsa lessons to be able to shake it out on the dance floor. It's cute to see everybody excited about dancing Salsa at the wedding. I have the DJ Adan Mijares... I just got his name this past weekend from the coordinator. I haven't heard anything about him. I have a feeling all the DJs down there are about the same.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karlaroldan@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1153925280,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206766.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":56,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KARLA","Id":206766,"Name":"KARLA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":314,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f094bcd1a815cc6a02c020f656263b00","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;KARLA&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;8 of us are all taking weekly Salsa lessons to be able to shake it out on the dance floor. It&#039;s cute to see everybody excited about dancing Salsa at the wedding. I have the DJ Adan Mijares... I just got his name this past weekend from the coordinator. I haven&#039;t heard anything about him. I have a feeling all the DJs down there are about the same.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;i took salsa lessons with my parents...they love to salsa!\n \n and i think you are right about DJ&#039;s down there...i haven&#039;t heard anyone rave about their DJ...the amazing thing is, it isnt that hard if they just follow the song list.&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/blink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Blink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1996,"PostDate":1159719116,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>KARLA<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">8 of us are all taking weekly Salsa lessons to be able to shake it out on the dance floor. It's cute to see everybody excited about dancing Salsa at the wedding. I have the DJ Adan Mijares... I just got his name this past weekend from the coordinator. I haven't heard anything about him. I have a feeling all the DJs down there are about the same.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>i took salsa lessons with my parents...they love to salsa!<br \/> <br \/> and i think you are right about DJ's down there...i haven't heard anyone rave about their DJ...the amazing thing is, it isnt that hard if they just follow the song list.<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/blink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Blink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137209820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":314,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"571756158418640144e650e73b847f94","RawContent":"Aren&#039;t salsa lessonss fun? I love him, but my poor FI doesn&#039;t have much rhythm. Regarding the music, I&#039;m buring the few songs I think the DJ won&#039;t know on a CD just in case. I figure it&#039;s better to be safe than sorry!","Attachments":[],"Id":2053,"PostDate":1159804590,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Aren't salsa lessonss fun? I love him, but my poor FI doesn't have much rhythm. Regarding the music, I'm buring the few songs I think the DJ won't know on a CD just in case. I figure it's better to be safe than sorry!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>MariaElena - 10\/28\/06<br>Hilton \/ San Jose Catholic Church<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"murillo_me@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1149702000,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206744.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":44,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MARIAELM","Id":206744,"Name":"MARIAELM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":314,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"82d42052b803a323af5dc9b48de9c0ed","RawContent":"Yeah, I really do not have very high expectations regarding the DJ... which is so unfortunate since he is a chunk of my budget. \n \n We have had so much fun doing the Salsa lessons. I really hope we can at least sort of look like we know what we&#039;re doing out on the dance floor!","Attachments":[],"Id":2065,"PostDate":1159809741,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yeah, I really do not have very high expectations regarding the DJ... which is so unfortunate since he is a chunk of my budget. <br \/> <br \/> We have had so much fun doing the Salsa lessons. I really hope we can at least sort of look like we know what we're doing out on the dance floor!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karlaroldan@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1153925280,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206766.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":56,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KARLA","Id":206766,"Name":"KARLA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":314,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2012bfdc2d1e05226c5189db850e469e","RawContent":"I know - I am really nervous about the DJ! I can&#039;t imagien they&#039;re going ot be very good... I&#039;m leaning towards an iPod, a fancy soound system and designating a friend to be in charge. Has anyone done this successfully yet? Hmmm... maybe I&#039;ll post a new thread for that question - seems ripe for discussion! to iPod or not ti iPod - that is the question.","Attachments":[],"Id":3016,"PostDate":1160614900,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I know - I am really nervous about the DJ! I can't imagien they're going ot be very good... I'm leaning towards an iPod, a fancy soound system and designating a friend to be in charge. Has anyone done this successfully yet? Hmmm... maybe I'll post a new thread for that question - seems ripe for discussion! to iPod or not ti iPod - that is the question.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Kashmira & Dan<\/span><br><span>Happily married since June 16, 2007<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i95.photobucket.com\/albums\/l139\/gkashmira\/IMG_0769.jpg\">http:\/\/i95.photobucket.com\/albums\/l1...a\/IMG_0769.jpg<\/a><br><span>Our mini-video: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bajavideoproductions.com\/Kash_Dan.html\">http:\/\/www.bajavideoproductions.com\/Kash_Dan.html<\/a><br><span>Photo slideshow: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.tomasbarron.com\/recent.php\">http:\/\/www.tomasbarron.com\/recent.php<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"gkashmira@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1156793160,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206698.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":81,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gkashmira","Id":206698,"Name":"gkashmira","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":314,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"15f4000ac78168b77eecc8d565c4cd8d","RawContent":"And finally, here is our song list. Thank you girls for posting, it really helped getting us started.\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Tim and Karla&#039;s Wedding Song List&lt;\/strong&gt;\n \n First Song for Bride and Groom\n At Last - Etta James\n Bride&#039;s Song with Dad\n What a Wonderful World - Louis Armstrong\n Groom&#039;s song with Mom\n The Dance - Garth Brooks\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Slow Songs&lt;\/strong&gt;\n When I Fall In Love - Nat King Cole\n Unforgettable - Natalie and Nat King Cole\n Mona Lisa \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Nat King Cole\n I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve Got the World on a String \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Frank Sinatra\n Nice and Easy \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Frank Sinatra\n You Make Me Feel So Young \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Frank Sinatra\n Night and Day \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Frank Sinatra\n Strangers in the night \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Frank Sinatra\n The Best is Yet To Come \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Tony Bennett\n The Way You Look Tonight \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Tony Bennett\n A Kiss To Build A Dream On \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Louis Armstrong\n Home \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Michael Buble`\n Try and Little Tenderness \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Michael Buble`\n I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve Got You Under My Skin \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Michael Buble`\n You and I \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Michael Buble`\n Feeling Good \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Michael Buble`\n Wink and a Smile \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Harry Connick Jr.\n It Had to Be You \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Harry Connick Jr.\n City Love \u00e2\u20ac\u201c John Mayer\n Thank You \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Dido \n ONE \u00e2\u20ac\u201c U2\n Better Together \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Jack Johnson\n I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ll Be \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Edwin McCain\n No Ordinary Love \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Sade\n Wonderful Tonight \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Eric Clapton\n From this Moment - Shania Twain\n One True Love \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Neil Diamond\n Everything I Do \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Bryan Adams\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Dance Songs (Spanish) \u00e2\u20ac\u201c To play early in the night&lt;\/strong&gt;\n Carlos Vives - Fruta Fresca\n Gipsy Kings - Medley: Bamboleo, Volare, Djobi Djoba, Pida Me La, Baila Me\n Ricky Martin \u00e2\u20ac\u201c La Bomba\n Ricky Martin - Maria\n Ricky Martin - Por Arriba, Por Abajo\n Shakira - La Tortura\n Shakira - Ojos Asi\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Salsa - To play early in the night&lt;\/strong&gt;\n Play best from DJ\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s selection\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Fun Songs - To play early in the night&lt;\/strong&gt;\n Brown Eyed Girl \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Van Morrison\n You shook me all night long - AC\/DC\n come on eileen - dexy&#039;s midnight runners\n Shout - otis day, isley brothers\n mambo #5 - lou vega\n get down tonight - kc and the sunshine band\n I&#039;m Too Sexy - Right Said Fred\n Bob Marley \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Is this Love\n Garth Brooks - Two Pina Coladas\n Prince \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Kiss\n Tone Loc - Wild Thing\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Dance Songs \u00e2\u20ac\u201c To play later in the night&lt;\/strong&gt;\n I Like The Way (You Move) \u00e2\u20ac\u201c BodyRockers\n Don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t cha \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Pussycat Dolls\n Sexy Back \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Justin Timberlake\n Temperature \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Sean Jean\n Pon De Replay \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Rihanna\n Ain\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t No Other Man \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Christina Aguilera\n Sugar \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Trick Daddy\n Usher \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Yeah\n Headsprung \u00e2\u20ac\u201c LL Cool J\n In Da CLub - 50 cent\n Crazy in Love \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Beyonce\/Jay Z\n Disco Inferno \u00e2\u20ac\u201c 50 Cent\n Yeah - Usher w\/ludacris\n Get low - Lil jon\n Hot in heurre \u00e2\u20ac\u201c nelly\n It takes two to make a thing go right \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Rob Base\n Rump Shaker - Wrecks N Effect\n Lil Kim \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Jump Off\n Hey Mama \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Black Eyed Peas\n Lights Camera Action \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Mr. Cheeks\n Jumpin, Jumpin - Destiny\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Child\n Independent Women - Destiny\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Child","Attachments":[],"Id":4500,"PostDate":1161798262,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                And finally, here is our song list. Thank you girls for posting, it really helped getting us started.<br \/> <br \/> <strong>Tim and Karla's Wedding Song List<\/strong><br \/> <br \/> First Song for Bride and Groom<br \/> At Last - Etta James<br \/> Bride's Song with Dad<br \/> What a Wonderful World - Louis Armstrong<br \/> Groom's song with Mom<br \/> The Dance - Garth Brooks<br \/> <br \/> <strong>Slow Songs<\/strong><br \/> When I Fall In Love - Nat King Cole<br \/> Unforgettable - Natalie and Nat King Cole<br \/> Mona Lisa \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Nat King Cole<br \/> I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve Got the World on a String \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Frank Sinatra<br \/> Nice and Easy \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Frank Sinatra<br \/> You Make Me Feel So Young \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Frank Sinatra<br \/> Night and Day \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Frank Sinatra<br \/> Strangers in the night \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Frank Sinatra<br \/> The Best is Yet To Come \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Tony Bennett<br \/> The Way You Look Tonight \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Tony Bennett<br \/> A Kiss To Build A Dream On \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Louis Armstrong<br \/> Home \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Michael Buble`<br \/> Try and Little Tenderness \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Michael Buble`<br \/> I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve Got You Under My Skin \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Michael Buble`<br \/> You and I \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Michael Buble`<br \/> Feeling Good \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Michael Buble`<br \/> Wink and a Smile \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Harry Connick Jr.<br \/> It Had to Be You \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Harry Connick Jr.<br \/> City Love \u00e2\u20ac\u201c John Mayer<br \/> Thank You \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Dido <br \/> ONE \u00e2\u20ac\u201c U2<br \/> Better Together \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Jack Johnson<br \/> I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ll Be \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Edwin McCain<br \/> No Ordinary Love \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Sade<br \/> Wonderful Tonight \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Eric Clapton<br \/> From this Moment - Shania Twain<br \/> One True Love \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Neil Diamond<br \/> Everything I Do \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Bryan Adams<br \/> <br \/> <strong>Dance Songs (Spanish) \u00e2\u20ac\u201c To play early in the night<\/strong><br \/> Carlos Vives - Fruta Fresca<br \/> Gipsy Kings - Medley: Bamboleo, Volare, Djobi Djoba, Pida Me La, Baila Me<br \/> Ricky Martin \u00e2\u20ac\u201c La Bomba<br \/> Ricky Martin - Maria<br \/> Ricky Martin - Por Arriba, Por Abajo<br \/> Shakira - La Tortura<br \/> Shakira - Ojos Asi<br \/> <br \/> <strong>Salsa - To play early in the night<\/strong><br \/> Play best from DJ\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s selection<br \/> <br \/> <strong>Fun Songs - To play early in the night<\/strong><br \/> Brown Eyed Girl \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Van Morrison<br \/> You shook me all night long - AC\/DC<br \/> come on eileen - dexy's midnight runners<br \/> Shout - otis day, isley brothers<br \/> mambo #5 - lou vega<br \/> get down tonight - kc and the sunshine band<br \/> I'm Too Sexy - Right Said Fred<br \/> Bob Marley \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Is this Love<br \/> Garth Brooks - Two Pina Coladas<br \/> Prince \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Kiss<br \/> Tone Loc - Wild Thing<br \/> <br \/> <strong>Dance Songs \u00e2\u20ac\u201c To play later in the night<\/strong><br \/> I Like The Way (You Move) \u00e2\u20ac\u201c BodyRockers<br \/> Don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t cha \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Pussycat Dolls<br \/> Sexy Back \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Justin Timberlake<br \/> Temperature \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Sean Jean<br \/> Pon De Replay \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Rihanna<br \/> Ain\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t No Other Man \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Christina Aguilera<br \/> Sugar \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Trick Daddy<br \/> Usher \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Yeah<br \/> Headsprung \u00e2\u20ac\u201c LL Cool J<br \/> In Da CLub - 50 cent<br \/> Crazy in Love \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Beyonce\/Jay Z<br \/> Disco Inferno \u00e2\u20ac\u201c 50 Cent<br \/> Yeah - Usher w\/ludacris<br \/> Get low - Lil jon<br \/> Hot in heurre \u00e2\u20ac\u201c nelly<br \/> It takes two to make a thing go right \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Rob Base<br \/> Rump Shaker - Wrecks N Effect<br \/> Lil Kim \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Jump Off<br \/> Hey Mama \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Black Eyed Peas<br \/> Lights Camera Action \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Mr. Cheeks<br \/> Jumpin, Jumpin - Destiny\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Child<br \/> Independent Women - Destiny\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Child\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karlaroldan@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1153925280,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206766.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":56,"PhotoType":"custom"},"Forma