{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":1362,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":103060,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":545770,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":207723,"Name":"lscilley","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207723.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1230844292,"LastPoster":{"Id":281655,"Name":"MMwedding2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":22,"Preview":{"Id":545770,"PostDate":1230844292,"PostContent":"I have seen more and more people joining the forum and having as much trouble as I was finding ou...","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cF3I0g000800MjA3NTk0b3wwNTI5c3xPdXIgV2VkZGluZyBpbiBQdW50YSBDYW5hIQ.gif\">http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cF3I0g0008...YSBDYW5hIQ.gif<\/a><br><br><span>20 booked so far!!<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i67.photobucket.com\/albums\/h304\/loveisblonde2\/bdw5v1.jpg\">http:\/\/i67.photobucket.com\/albums\/h3...de2\/bdw5v1.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"leslie.scilley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1189645358,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207723.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lscilley","Id":207723,"Name":"lscilley","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1cb7c9fad6b99d0e658b6af64f5810a2","RawContent":"&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/welcome4.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Welcome4\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"&gt;I have seen more and more people joining the forum and having as much trouble as I was finding out information on The Majestic Colonial. So I figured I would help out others by posting all the information I have in one place for everyone to easily find. I don&#039;t have much on The Majestic Elgance but since they are sister hotels from what I have seen or heard they are pretty similar other than the Elegance has an Adults Only Area. &lt;\/font&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/thewave.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Thewave\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n \n &lt;u&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\"&gt;Brides to Be:&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile159\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;\n *If you are a bride to be just reply to this thread and I will add you to the list.*&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"&gt;lscilley-November 16, 2009 Colonial&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"&gt;\n \n &lt;font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;~All prices are in US~&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;u&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\"&gt;Colonial Wedding Packages 2008\/2009&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;\n \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Specialized assistance of our wedding planner \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Location of your choice: White sand Beach, our Magnificent Gazebo or your own Suite.\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Room Up Grade (Subject to availability) for the couple.\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Early Check in and Late check out (subject to availability)\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Services of a Civil Judge \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Beautiful decorated wedding Cake for the group\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Bouquet for the table \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Ironing of grooms tuxedo and bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s gown\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Simultaneous Translation of the ceremony if needed \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Marriage Certificate in Spanish\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Marriage certificate delivered by UPS\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Cocktail drinks after the Ceremony for the group\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Candle light romantic dinner for the couple with champagne\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Romantic breakfast in your suite.\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a210% Discounts on any SPA treatment for the couple.\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a215% Discounts on Horse back ridding\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Basket of fruits on your room during your stay\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Bottle of champagne in the room. Twice during your Stay.\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Room service Included for the couple.\n \n Price for Package: $1500\n Price for Package with live SAXO music for 30 minutes: $1750\n \n &lt;font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Required documents&lt;\/strong&gt;\n ~Photocopy of Birth Certificates translated into Spanish\n ~Photocopys of Passports for couple and witnesses \n ~Decleration of Single Status translated into Spanish and Notarized\n ~Original Divorce Decree translated in to Spanish and legalized\n *Documents needed to be transalted and legalized by the Dominican Embassy*&lt;\/font&gt;\n \n \n &lt;u&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\"&gt;Symbolic Ceremony&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Specialized assistance of our wedding planner \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Location of your choice: White Sand Beach, our Magnificent Gazebo or your own Suite.\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Room up grade (subject to availability) for the couple.\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Early Check in and Late check out (subject to availability)\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Beautiful decorated Wedding Cake for the group\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Bouquet for the table \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Ironing of grooms tuxedo and bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s gown\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Simultaneous translation of the ceremony if needed \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Champagne after the Ceremony for the group\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Candle light romantic dinner for the couple with champagne\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Romantic breakfast in your suite.\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a210% Discounts on any SPA treatment for the couple.\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a215% Discounts on Horseback Riding\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Basket of fruits on your room during your stay\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Bottle of champagne in the room. Twice during your Stay.\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Room service Included for the couple.\n \n Price $1250&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt; *Required docuements &lt;\/strong&gt;\n ~ Copy of marriage certificate&lt;\/font&gt;\n \n &lt;font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"&gt;&lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\"&gt;Reception Options:&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"&gt;Private reception with dinner by the pool - $55 + 26%\/person\n Private reception with dinner by the ocean - $65 + 26%\/person \n Special Private Party with dinner at Parrot Bar -$55 +26%\/person BBQ Menu\n Just a Party at Parrot Bar - $300 location rental fee + open bar + music\n Just a Party on the Beach - $400 location rental fee +open bar + music (see below for open bar and music costs)\n Party and Dinner in Presidental Suite -$55 +26%\/person + $1000 rental fee + open bar + music&lt;\/font&gt;\n Party in Presidental Suite - $1000\/24hrs for location fee + open bar + music\n Private Party in Disco - $500\/hour + DJ + opne bar\n Non-Private Set Dinner Menu for whole group at either The Rodeo(Steakhouse) or Tres Carabelas(Seafood)- FREE * note they do section off an area for your group*\n \n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Open Bar:&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/shots.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Shots\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/b&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n *Please note you do not have to do the open bar as I am not*\n National-$15 +26%\/person\/hour\n International-$25+26%\/person\/hour\n Premium-$35+26%\/person\/hour\n Bartender Fee-$15\/hour\/each bartender\n \n &lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\"&gt;Music:&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n DJ-$225\/hour\n Sound System Rental-$250\n Live Band -$2500 for 3 hours\n Traditional Dominican Band-$300\/hour\n Trio-$300\/hour\n \n &lt;u&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\"&gt;Flowers:&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;\n Bridal Bouquet-$65+16%\n Bridesmaid Bouquets-$55+16%\n Mother Corsage-$40+16%\n Boutonnierres-$6+16%\n Basic Center Pieces-$50+16%\n \n &lt;i&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\"&gt;Hotel Photgrapher: Tropical Pictures&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;\n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Bronze:&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n Photography of Ceremony with half an hour after ceremony for a beach or garden session with the newlywed couple, two sets of 50 Photographs printed in 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009dx 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d format, the photos will vary from Color to B\/W to Sepia. Cost- $550\n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Silver:&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n Pre wedding session of Photography with a total of 20 pictures. Photography of preparation of bride and groom in rooms, photography of ceremony, with an hour after ceremony for a beach or garden session with the newlywed couple, two sets of 100 photographs printed in 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009dx 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d format, 10 photographs printed in 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009dx 12\u00e2\u20ac\u009d as selected by couple, a DVD presentation of Photographs with music, the photos will vary from Color to B\/W to Sepia. Cost-$1,000\n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Gold:&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n Photography preparation of bride and groom in rooms, photography of ceremony, with an hour after ceremony for a beach or garden session with the newlywed couple, Photographs of reception until the cutting of the cake, two sets of 150 Photographs printed in 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009dx 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d format, 20 photographs printed in 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009dx 12\u00e2\u20ac\u009d as selected by couple, a DVD presentation of Photographs with music, a 30 Photographs session pre or post wedding with different clothing of the couple. \n Cost-$1,800\n \n Video of wedding ceremony-$350\n Video of wedding ceremony and reception-$700\n Digital Album of photographs-$600\n \n &lt;strong&gt;ALL Packages come with a disc that serves as your negatives&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"&gt;\n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\"&gt;The Wedding Coordinators for Colonial are:&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n &lt;strong&gt;Massiel Jimenez Alvarez&lt;\/strong&gt;\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:weddings@majestic-resorts.com\"&gt;weddings@majestic-resorts.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Sandra de la Cruz&lt;\/strong&gt;\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:weddings1@majestic-resorts.com\"&gt;weddings1@majestic-resorts.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Aurelio Sanchez&lt;\/strong&gt;\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:weddings@majestic-resorts.com\"&gt;weddings@majestic-resorts.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\"&gt;For the Elegance are:&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n &lt;strong&gt;Larissa Brache Mejia&lt;\/strong&gt;\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:weddings2@majestic-resorts.com\"&gt;weddings2@majestic-resorts.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n \n \n \n &lt;font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\"&gt;Great sites for information:&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/jiggy.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Jiggy\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.majestic-resorts.com\"&gt;MAJESTIC RESORTS - Web Oficial ? HOTEL MAJESTIC COLONIAL ? HOTEL MAJESTIC ELEGANCE ? HOTELES REPUBLICA DOMINICANA -HOTEL RESORTS PUNTA CANA - PLAYA BAVARO TODO INCLUIDO-&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/board.php?uid=2406102439&amp;amp;f=2&amp;amp;start=90&amp;amp;hash=1432527e21a416db4d8c7ff6e5556754#\/group.php?gid=2406102439\"&gt;Majestic Colonial Brides!! Discussions | Facebook&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.debbiesdominicantravel.com\/wedding\"&gt;www.debbiesdominicantravel.com\/wedding&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n \n \n &lt;font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;I will also be posting some pictures of the hotel and reception areas in another post.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n \n Here are Menus for The Rodeo, Taino(Mexican), BBQ Dinner, and Hor derve&#039;s for receptions and what each section of the Open Bar contains:&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;5593&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;BBQ Buffet Dinner.doc&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:20,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;doc&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;5596&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Hors D Ouvres Appetizers.doc&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:525,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;doc&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;5597&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Open Bar English.doc&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:547.5,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;doc&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;5598&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;New Rodeo Grill.pdf&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:222.67578125,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;pdf&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":545770,"PostDate":1230844292,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/welcome4.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Welcome4\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"><font face=\"Comic Sans MS\">I have seen more and more people joining the forum and having as much trouble as I was finding out information on The Majestic Colonial. So I figured I would help out others by posting all the information I have in one place for everyone to easily find. I don't have much on The Majestic Elgance but since they are sister hotels from what I have seen or heard they are pretty similar other than the Elegance has an Adults Only Area. <\/font><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/thewave.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Thewave\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <u><i><strong><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\">Brides to Be:<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile159\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><\/font><\/font><\/strong><\/i><\/u><br \/> *If you are a bride to be just reply to this thread and I will add you to the list.*<\/font><br \/> <font face=\"Comic Sans MS\">lscilley-November 16, 2009 Colonial<\/font><br \/> <font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"><br \/> <br \/> <font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"><strong>~All prices are in US~<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <u><i><strong><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\">Colonial Wedding Packages 2008\/2009<\/font><\/font><\/strong><\/i><\/u><br \/> <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Specialized assistance of our wedding planner <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Location of your choice: White sand Beach, our Magnificent Gazebo or your own Suite.<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Room Up Grade (Subject to availability) for the couple.<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Early Check in and Late check out (subject to availability)<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Services of a Civil Judge <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Beautiful decorated wedding Cake for the group<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Bouquet for the table <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Ironing of grooms tuxedo and bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s gown<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Simultaneous Translation of the ceremony if needed <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Marriage Certificate in Spanish<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Marriage certificate delivered by UPS<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Cocktail drinks after the Ceremony for the group<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Candle light romantic dinner for the couple with champagne<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Romantic breakfast in your suite.<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a210% Discounts on any SPA treatment for the couple.<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a215% Discounts on Horse back ridding<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Basket of fruits on your room during your stay<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Bottle of champagne in the room. Twice during your Stay.<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Room service Included for the couple.<br \/> <br \/> Price for Package: $1500<br \/> Price for Package with live SAXO music for 30 minutes: $1750<br \/> <br \/> <font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"><strong>*Required documents<\/strong><br \/> ~Photocopy of Birth Certificates translated into Spanish<br \/> ~Photocopys of Passports for couple and witnesses <br \/> ~Decleration of Single Status translated into Spanish and Notarized<br \/> ~Original Divorce Decree translated in to Spanish and legalized<br \/> *Documents needed to be transalted and legalized by the Dominican Embassy*<\/font><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <u><i><strong><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\">Symbolic Ceremony<\/font><\/font><\/strong><\/i><\/u><br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Specialized assistance of our wedding planner <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Location of your choice: White Sand Beach, our Magnificent Gazebo or your own Suite.<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Room up grade (subject to availability) for the couple.<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Early Check in and Late check out (subject to availability)<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Beautiful decorated Wedding Cake for the group<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Bouquet for the table <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Ironing of grooms tuxedo and bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s gown<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Simultaneous translation of the ceremony if needed <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Champagne after the Ceremony for the group<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Candle light romantic dinner for the couple with champagne<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Romantic breakfast in your suite.<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a210% Discounts on any SPA treatment for the couple.<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a215% Discounts on Horseback Riding<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Basket of fruits on your room during your stay<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Bottle of champagne in the room. Twice during your Stay.<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Room service Included for the couple.<br \/> <br \/> Price $1250<\/font><br \/> <font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"><strong> *Required docuements <\/strong><br \/> ~ Copy of marriage certificate<\/font><br \/> <br \/> <font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"><font size=\"3\"><u><strong><i><font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\">Reception Options:<\/font><\/i><\/strong><\/u><\/font><br \/> <font face=\"Comic Sans MS\">Private reception with dinner by the pool - $55 + 26%\/person<br \/> Private reception with dinner by the ocean - $65 + 26%\/person <br \/> Special Private Party with dinner at Parrot Bar -$55 +26%\/person BBQ Menu<br \/> Just a Party at Parrot Bar - $300 location rental fee + open bar + music<br \/> Just a Party on the Beach - $400 location rental fee +open bar + music (see below for open bar and music costs)<br \/> Party and Dinner in Presidental Suite -$55 +26%\/person + $1000 rental fee + open bar + music<\/font><br \/> Party in Presidental Suite - $1000\/24hrs for location fee + open bar + music<br \/> Private Party in Disco - $500\/hour + DJ + opne bar<br \/> Non-Private Set Dinner Menu for whole group at either The Rodeo(Steakhouse) or Tres Carabelas(Seafood)- FREE * note they do section off an area for your group*<br \/> <br \/> <font size=\"3\"><u><i><strong><font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\"><b>Open Bar:<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/shots.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Shots\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><\/strong><\/font><\/b><\/i><\/u><\/font><br \/> *Please note you do not have to do the open bar as I am not*<br \/> National-$15 +26%\/person\/hour<br \/> International-$25+26%\/person\/hour<br \/> Premium-$35+26%\/person\/hour<br \/> Bartender Fee-$15\/hour\/each bartender<br \/> <br \/> <font size=\"3\"><u><i><strong><font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\">Music:<\/font><\/strong><\/i><\/u><\/font><br \/> DJ-$225\/hour<br \/> Sound System Rental-$250<br \/> Live Band -$2500 for 3 hours<br \/> Traditional Dominican Band-$300\/hour<br \/> Trio-$300\/hour<br \/> <br \/> <u><i><strong><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\">Flowers:<\/font><\/font><\/strong><\/i><\/u><br \/> Bridal Bouquet-$65+16%<br \/> Bridesmaid Bouquets-$55+16%<br \/> Mother Corsage-$40+16%<br \/> Boutonnierres-$6+16%<br \/> Basic Center Pieces-$50+16%<br \/> <br \/> <i><strong><u><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\">Hotel Photgrapher: Tropical Pictures<\/font><\/font><\/u><\/strong><\/i><br \/> <br \/> <strong><u>Bronze:<\/u><\/strong><br \/> Photography of Ceremony with half an hour after ceremony for a beach or garden session with the newlywed couple, two sets of 50 Photographs printed in 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009dx 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d format, the photos will vary from Color to B\/W to Sepia. Cost- $550<br \/> <br \/> <strong><u>Silver:<\/u><\/strong><br \/> Pre wedding session of Photography with a total of 20 pictures. Photography of preparation of bride and groom in rooms, photography of ceremony, with an hour after ceremony for a beach or garden session with the newlywed couple, two sets of 100 photographs printed in 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009dx 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d format, 10 photographs printed in 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009dx 12\u00e2\u20ac\u009d as selected by couple, a DVD presentation of Photographs with music, the photos will vary from Color to B\/W to Sepia. Cost-$1,000<br \/> <br \/> <strong><u>Gold:<\/u><\/strong><br \/> Photography preparation of bride and groom in rooms, photography of ceremony, with an hour after ceremony for a beach or garden session with the newlywed couple, Photographs of reception until the cutting of the cake, two sets of 150 Photographs printed in 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009dx 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d format, 20 photographs printed in 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009dx 12\u00e2\u20ac\u009d as selected by couple, a DVD presentation of Photographs with music, a 30 Photographs session pre or post wedding with different clothing of the couple. <br \/> Cost-$1,800<br \/> <br \/> Video of wedding ceremony-$350<br \/> Video of wedding ceremony and reception-$700<br \/> Digital Album of photographs-$600<br \/> <br \/> <strong>ALL Packages come with a disc that serves as your negatives<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"><br \/> <strong><u><font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\">The Wedding Coordinators for Colonial are:<\/font><\/u><\/strong><br \/> <strong>Massiel Jimenez Alvarez<\/strong><br \/> <a href='mailto:weddings@majestic-resorts.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>weddings@majestic-resorts.com<\/a><br \/> <br \/> <strong>Sandra de la Cruz<\/strong><br \/> <a href='mailto:weddings1@majestic-resorts.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>weddings1@majestic-resorts.com<\/a><br \/> <br \/> <strong>Aurelio Sanchez<\/strong><br \/> <a href='mailto:weddings@majestic-resorts.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>weddings@majestic-resorts.com<\/a><br \/> <br \/> <strong><u><font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\">For the Elegance are:<\/font><\/u><\/strong><br \/> <strong>Larissa Brache Mejia<\/strong><br \/> <a href='mailto:weddings2@majestic-resorts.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>weddings2@majestic-resorts.com<\/a><\/font><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"><strong><u><font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\">Great sites for information:<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/jiggy.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Jiggy\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><\/font><\/u><\/strong><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.majestic-resorts.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>MAJESTIC RESORTS - Web Oficial ? HOTEL MAJESTIC COLONIAL ? HOTEL MAJESTIC ELEGANCE ? HOTELES REPUBLICA DOMINICANA -HOTEL RESORTS PUNTA CANA - PLAYA BAVARO TODO INCLUIDO-<\/a><br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/board.php?uid=2406102439&f=2&start=90&hash=1432527e21a416db4d8c7ff6e5556754#\/group.php?gid=2406102439' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Majestic Colonial Brides!! Discussions | Facebook<\/a><br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.debbiesdominicantravel.com\/wedding' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.debbiesdominicantravel.com\/wedding<\/a><\/font><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"><strong>I will also be posting some pictures of the hotel and reception areas in another post.<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <br \/> Here are Menus for The Rodeo, Taino(Mexican), BBQ Dinner, and Hor derve's for receptions and what each section of the Open Bar contains:<p>\u00a0<\/p><span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"5593\",\"name\":\"BBQ Buffet Dinner.doc\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":20,\"type\":\"doc\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span><p>\u00a0<\/p><span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"5596\",\"name\":\"Hors D Ouvres Appetizers.doc\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":525,\"type\":\"doc\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span><p>\u00a0<\/p><span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"5597\",\"name\":\"Open Bar English.doc\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":547.5,\"type\":\"doc\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span><p>\u00a0<\/p><span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"5598\",\"name\":\"New Rodeo Grill.pdf\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":222.67578125,\"type\":\"pdf\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cF3I0g000800MjA3NTk0b3wwNTI5c3xPdXIgV2VkZGluZyBpbiBQdW50YSBDYW5hIQ.gif\">http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cF3I0g0008...YSBDYW5hIQ.gif<\/a><br><br><span>20 booked so far!!<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i67.photobucket.com\/albums\/h304\/loveisblonde2\/bdw5v1.jpg\">http:\/\/i67.photobucket.com\/albums\/h3...de2\/bdw5v1.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"leslie.scilley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1189645358,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207723.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lscilley","Id":207723,"Name":"lscilley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e939d603808fd1284522b39cf478f622","RawContent":"wow this is a great post!!!!!!!!!!! thanks, i wish i had thought of this. very very helpful. I&#039;m going to ask the WC for specific Majestic Elegance info (aka restaurant and ceremony locale info) and will try to post once I get my hands on it.","Attachments":[],"Id":545988,"PostDate":1230862934,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                wow this is a great post!!!!!!!!!!! thanks, i wish i had thought of this. very very helpful. I'm going to ask the WC for specific Majestic Elegance info (aka restaurant and ceremony locale info) and will try to post once I get my hands on it.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"landolfe@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1218335520,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211091.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"landolfe","Id":211091,"Name":"landolfe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b953e0a241a74cf023e4b9392c2b10c","RawContent":"This is AMAZING!! Thank you so much for putting this together.","Attachments":[],"Id":546003,"PostDate":1230865496,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This is AMAZING!! Thank you so much for putting this together.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i34.photobucket.com\/albums\/d143\/jennifer-lynn\/Summer%2009\/IMG_2975.jpg\">http:\/\/i34.photobucket.com\/albums\/d1...9\/IMG_2975.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jennifergatti@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1227071416,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212756.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":88,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jen_trev","Id":212756,"Name":"jen_trev","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e1d4a182face2b336a3e758e063f054a","RawContent":"Thanks, great info. It is quite true that not much information is available on the Elegance. I have no idea what I&#039;m getting into but I don&#039;t sweat the small details at all.","Attachments":[],"Id":546259,"PostDate":1230908848,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks, great info. It is quite true that not much information is available on the Elegance. I have no idea what I'm getting into but I don't sweat the small details at all.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lbessette01@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1216076156,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210534.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":55,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"trance_angelx0x","Id":210534,"Name":"trance_angelx0x","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c6b3c6e5038d45d5a561a463a9542af1","RawContent":"Great post. The Colonial is an amazing resort. I&#039;ll be going to the Elegance for the first time next week to shoot a few weddings. If there is any info I can add to help the Elegance brides I&#039;ll definitely do so. \n \n If you have any specific questions that you would like me to ask in person post them here and I&#039;ll get your the answers while I am there.","Attachments":[],"Id":546355,"PostDate":1230915231,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Great post. The Colonial is an amazing resort. I'll be going to the Elegance for the first time next week to shoot a few weddings. If there is any info I can add to help the Elegance brides I'll definitely do so. <br \/> <br \/> If you have any specific questions that you would like me to ask in person post them here and I'll get your the answers while I am there.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mail@josh-brown.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1216603080,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210662.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joshfrommontreal","Id":210662,"Name":"joshfrommontreal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"75d606676f5a86603e31c4b0cdadc6ad","RawContent":"Are you sure Larissa is still there at the elegance? I heard she was no longer there...........","Attachments":[],"Id":546786,"PostDate":1230938626,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Are you sure Larissa is still there at the elegance? I heard she was no longer there...........\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tac.families.com\/ezb\/1171692.png\">http:\/\/tac.families.com\/ezb\/1171692.png<\/a><br><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tac.families.com\/ezb\/1171691.png\">http:\/\/tac.families.com\/ezb\/1171691.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cmk22@optonline.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1224526209,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212343.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Christinamaria22","Id":212343,"Name":"Christinamaria22","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"af65e2c8c3ce01c91730792e4837a381","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Christinamaria22&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Are you sure Larissa is still there at the elegance? I heard she was no longer there...........&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;No I am not sure that was the last information I had that she moved from the Colonial to the Elegance. The coordinators seem to change all the time but I am sure that no matter who it is by emailing the address you will get one of them.","Attachments":[],"Id":546833,"PostDate":1230940995,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Christinamaria22<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Are you sure Larissa is still there at the elegance? I heard she was no longer there...........<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>No I am not sure that was the last information I had that she moved from the Colonial to the Elegance. The coordinators seem to change all the time but I am sure that no matter who it is by emailing the address you will get one of them.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cF3I0g000800MjA3NTk0b3wwNTI5c3xPdXIgV2VkZGluZyBpbiBQdW50YSBDYW5hIQ.gif\">http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cF3I0g0008...YSBDYW5hIQ.gif<\/a><br><br><span>20 booked so far!!<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i67.photobucket.com\/albums\/h304\/loveisblonde2\/bdw5v1.jpg\">http:\/\/i67.photobucket.com\/albums\/h3...de2\/bdw5v1.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"leslie.scilley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1189645358,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207723.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lscilley","Id":207723,"Name":"lscilley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"67d65a9e066dee8ca5fb7d7412407c98","RawContent":"Here are some pictures I have recieved from the hotel and other people who have had weddings there:\n \n Beach Ceremony Basic Setup\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i256.photobucket.com\/albums\/hh187\/lscilley\/n515792869_214135_5811.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n The Parrot Bar\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i256.photobucket.com\/albums\/hh187\/lscilley\/n840145440_1158936_3445.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i256.photobucket.com\/albums\/hh187\/lscilley\/SANY0066.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n The Presidental Suite Balcony\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i256.photobucket.com\/albums\/hh187\/lscilley\/SANY1005.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i256.photobucket.com\/albums\/hh187\/lscilley\/n901215173_3046173_2726.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Setup in Resturants for Dinner\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i256.photobucket.com\/albums\/hh187\/lscilley\/n668588439_141945_3047.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i256.photobucket.com\/albums\/hh187\/lscilley\/n508377449_204282_2429.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n The Gazebo\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i256.photobucket.com\/albums\/hh187\/lscilley\/majestic46.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":546849,"PostDate":1230941695,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here are some pictures I have recieved from the hotel and other people who have had weddings there:<br \/> <br \/> Beach Ceremony Basic Setup<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i256.photobucket.com\/albums\/hh187\/lscilley\/n515792869_214135_5811.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> The Parrot Bar<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i256.photobucket.com\/albums\/hh187\/lscilley\/n840145440_1158936_3445.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i256.photobucket.com\/albums\/hh187\/lscilley\/SANY0066.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> The Presidental Suite Balcony<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i256.photobucket.com\/albums\/hh187\/lscilley\/SANY1005.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i256.photobucket.com\/albums\/hh187\/lscilley\/n901215173_3046173_2726.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Setup in Resturants for Dinner<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i256.photobucket.com\/albums\/hh187\/lscilley\/n668588439_141945_3047.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i256.photobucket.com\/albums\/hh187\/lscilley\/n508377449_204282_2429.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> The Gazebo<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i256.photobucket.com\/albums\/hh187\/lscilley\/majestic46.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cF3I0g000800MjA3NTk0b3wwNTI5c3xPdXIgV2VkZGluZyBpbiBQdW50YSBDYW5hIQ.gif\">http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cF3I0g0008...YSBDYW5hIQ.gif<\/a><br><br><span>20 booked so far!!<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i67.photobucket.com\/albums\/h304\/loveisblonde2\/bdw5v1.jpg\">http:\/\/i67.photobucket.com\/albums\/h3...de2\/bdw5v1.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"leslie.scilley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1189645358,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207723.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lscilley","Id":207723,"Name":"lscilley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be1901c8c49e028c6c986d3f83002c7c","RawContent":"Hey ladies :) I photographed a wedding at the Majestic Colonial last April and you can see the pictures under Weddings on my website &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.robynlouiseclients.com\"&gt;Robyn Louise Photography Shopping Cart - Williams Lake, BC&lt;\/a&gt; - click on Kim and Jeff (about half way down the page). This is the entire gallery of images that I shot while at the Majestic Colonial so hopefully it gives you some idea of what a Gazebo wedding and restaurant reception would be like!","Attachments":[],"Id":546882,"PostDate":1230943546,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey ladies <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I photographed a wedding at the Majestic Colonial last April and you can see the pictures under Weddings on my website <a href='http:\/\/www.robynlouiseclients.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Robyn Louise Photography Shopping Cart - Williams Lake, BC<\/a> - click on Kim and Jeff (about half way down the page). This is the entire gallery of images that I shot while at the Majestic Colonial so hopefully it gives you some idea of what a Gazebo wedding and restaurant reception would be like!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"robyn.mumford@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1185213720,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207553.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Robyn Louise Photography","Id":207553,"Name":"Robyn Louise Photography","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ad4bce943eb69ff75ea214fdf0ae5cd4","RawContent":"Hello All! I am newly engaged and am looking into getting married at the Majestic Colonial! This thread is great and has provided more information than I have found anywhere else online! Thanks for the info! I look forward to hearing more about the resort and the weddings!! \n \n Erin","Attachments":[],"Id":547008,"PostDate":1230951327,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello All! I am newly engaged and am looking into getting married at the Majestic Colonial! This thread is great and has provided more information than I have found anywhere else online! Thanks for the info! I look forward to hearing more about the resort and the weddings!! <br \/> <br \/> Erin\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;130\/st\/20100327\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/d79b\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...d79b\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"erinsny27@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1230573637,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213402.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"erinsny24","Id":213402,"Name":"erinsny24","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"28528","Title":"Majestic Colonial or Elegance Brides Post Here","LastPostDate":1420811197},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1362,"TotalPages":137,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":1360},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
