l feel free to PM me as I am an Alberta bride too!<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/elefant.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Elefant\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Thanks Iscilley! I already have this thread bookmarked! If I come across any questions when we get into the planning some more, I will be sure to seek your wisdom <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>36 Booked!<\/strong><br><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.danandambie.com\">www.DanandAmbie.com<\/a><\/strong><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/w4r64qfilztm.png\">http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/w4r64qfilztm.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"amber.mackinnon@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1226293959,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212618.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SunnyCherries","Id":212618,"Name":"SunnyCherries","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6d31169d19b6d7fce15244f7dc414fb2","RawContent":"BUMP for any new members!!","Attachments":[],"Id":555773,"PostDate":1231550685,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n      