 body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                hi , thanks for the info its great,<br \/> does anyone know if they have any beach receptions?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nvargas@searshc.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1228417727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213008.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":113,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nvargasNY17","Id":213008,"Name":"nvargasNY17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a6e617f0db5bd9ad344a789aa0ba185e","RawContent":"yes you can do a beach reception with a full dinner which is like 50per person I think or you can rent a privtae spot for cake and music for i think 3 hours but I am still wiating for the wc to get back to me... I am using a resort restaurant for dinner and doing the private beach for cake and music Hope this helps.........","Attachments":[],"Id":557998,"PostDate":1231770977,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                yes you can do a beach reception with a full dinner which is like 50per person I think or you can rent a privtae spot for cake and music for i think 3 hours but I am still wiating for the wc to get back to me... I am using a resort restaurant for dinner and doing the private beach for cake and music Hope this helps.........\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tac.families.com\/ezb\/1171692.png\">http:\/\/tac.families.com\/ezb\/1171692.png<\/a><br><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tac.families.com\/ezb\/1171691.png\">http:\/\/tac.families.com\/ezb\/1171691.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cmk22@optonline.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1224526209,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212343.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Christinamaria22","Id":212343,"Name":"Christinamaria22","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ed05373eb308a5afa3de42867acbbae4","RawContent":"yes there are beach receptions, but they do cost extra. Like mentioned above it is about $50 per person plus it costs extra if you would like an open bar.","Attachments":[],"Id":558927,"PostDate":1231809336,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                yes there are beach receptions, but they do cost extra. Like mentioned above it is about $50 per person plus it costs extra if you would like an open bar.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mail@josh-brown.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1216603080,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210662.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joshfrommontreal","Id":210662,"Name":"joshfrommontreal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"066132985236eacd1d9a1eee631d00dd","RawContent":"These are most of your options: I posted all this info and more on the 1st page of this thread if you would like to see all that. I highlighted the beach option for you.\n \n Reception Options:\n Private reception with dinner by the pool - $55 + 26%\/person\n Private reception with dinner by the ocean - $65 + 26%\/person\n Special Private Party with dinner at Parrot Bar -$55 +26%\/person BBQ Menu\n Just a Party at Parrot Bar - $300 location rental fee + open bar + music\n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;font color=\"Blue\"&gt;Just a Party on the Beach - $400 location rental fee +open bar + music (see below for open bar and music costs)&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n Party and Dinner in Presidental Suite -$55 +26%\/person + $1000 rental fee + open bar + music\n Party in Presidental Suite - $1000\/24hrs for location fee + open bar + music\n Private Party in Disco - $500\/hour + DJ + opne bar\n Non-Private Set Dinner Menu for whole group at either The Rodeo(Steakhouse) or Tres Carabelas(Seafood)- FREE * note they do section off an area for your group*","Attachments":[],"Id":558932,"PostDate":1231809563,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                These are most of your options: I posted all this info and more on the 1st page of this thread if you would like to see all that. I highlighted the beach option for you.<br \/> <br \/> Reception Options:<br \/> Private reception with dinner by the pool - $55 + 26%\/person<br \/> Private reception with dinner by the ocean - $65 + 26%\/person<br \/> Special Private Party with dinner at Parrot Bar -$55 +26%\/person BBQ Menu<br \/> Just a Party at Parrot Bar - $300 location rental fee + open bar + music<br \/> <strong><u><font color=\"Blue\">Just a Party on the Beach - $400 location rental fee +open bar + music (see below for open bar and music costs)<\/font><\/u><\/strong><br \/> Party and Dinner in Presidental Suite -$55 +26%\/person + $1000 rental fee + open bar + music<br \/> Party in Presidental Suite - $1000\/24hrs for location fee + open bar + music<br \/> Private Party in Disco - $500\/hour + DJ + opne bar<br \/> Non-Private Set Dinner Menu for whole group at either The Rodeo(Steakhouse) or Tres Carabelas(Seafood)- FREE * note they do section off an area for your group*\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"