rstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1f6b567273c50b9495eab5ffec69273c","RawContent":":::2010 BRIDES:::\n \n Does anyone have their dates confirmed for 2010 yet? I have contacted them to secure a date for Jan 2010 (as we are trying to get a group rate organized) and they have told me they are not booking 2010 weddings until April of this year. \n \n However, some girls on another forum have their dates for the Majestic Colonial booked for all the way up to May 2010. \n \n Just wondering if anyone here has their date already or has had issues confirming a 2010 date?\n \n Thanks ladies!","Attachments":[],"Id":560173,"PostDate":1231899711,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                :::2010 BRIDES:::<br \/> <br \/> Does anyone have their dates confirmed for 2010 yet? I have contacted them to secure a date for Jan 2010 (as we are trying to get a group rate organized) and they have told me they are not booking 2010 weddings until April of this year. <br \/> <br \/> However, some girls on another forum have their dates for the Majestic Colonial booked for all the way up to May 2010. <br \/> <br \/> Just wondering if anyone here has their date already or has had issues confirming a 2010 date?<br \/> <br \/> Thanks ladies!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>36 Booked!<\/strong><br><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.danandambie.com\">www.DanandAmbie.com<\/a><\/strong><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/w4r64qfilztm.png\">http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/w4r64qfilztm.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"amber.mackinnon@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1226293959,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212618.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SunnyCherries","Id":212618,"Name":"SunnyCherries","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7632c7b5556df6c67a90fd369adf4e46","RawContent":"My trip is confirmed but my wedding date is not confirmed. I was told that they don&#039;t have pricing info yet for the 2010 wedding packages and once that becomes available then they will book my date.\n \n I fail to see what the price of the wedding has anything to do with setting the wedding date since I already put a deposit to go to that hotel anyway, not like I can change it without substantial penalty. DUHHHHHHHH","Attachments":[],"Id":561264,"PostDate":1231977645,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My trip is confirmed but my wedding date is not confirmed. I was told that they don't have pricing info yet for the 2010 wedding packages and once that becomes available then they will book my date.<br \/> <br \/> I fail to see what the price of the wedding has anything to do with setting the wedding date since I already put a deposit to go to that hotel anyway, not like I can change it without substantial penalty. DUHHHHHHHH\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lbessette01@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1216076156,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210534.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":55,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"trance_angelx0x","Id":210534,"Name":"trance_angelx0x","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2c172789b48cf32f2b67e7500940ae33","RawContent":"I got the same answer as you...they won&#039;t reserve our wedding date until the 2010 prices are out. Supposedly they are coming out within the next few weeks. We will see if they will actually let us confirm then! I hope so...I just want to book it already and send out my save the dates! \n \n Good Luck! Let me know if anyone hears anything about the 2010 prices being out.","Attachments":[],"Id":561719,"PostDate":1232026045,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n