      width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                thanks for all the info Iscilley! After several weeks of researching and debating, we've finally decided on the MC. The info you posted will be very helpful to us over the next few months. thanks again!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carolyn.guaca@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1229635461,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213259.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cgf","Id":213259,"Name":"cgf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a3303bd55b6c1cea9ba435d510dfdb46","RawContent":"Hi Erin how are you, have you decided on the majestic? I am debating on that one or the Melia or the Iberostar and not sure which to pick. Hoping you can give me some insight you have found.","Attachments":[],"Id":564876,"PostDate":1232329067,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Erin how are you, have you decided on the majestic? I am debating on that one or the Melia or the Iberostar and not sure which to pick. Hoping you can give me some insight you have found.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i>Jewels<\/i><\/div><\/div>","Email":"julie.sanchez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1232052946,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213986.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Steve&Julia","Id":213986,"Name":"Steve&Julia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e6a8ed997ebecbcddac4c3f01d0f6f07","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;SunnyCherries&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;:::2010 BRIDES:::\n \n Does anyone have their dates confirmed for 2010 yet? I have contacted them to secure a date for Jan 2010 (as we are trying to get a group rate organized) and they have told me they are not booking 2010 weddings until April of this year. \n \n However, some girls on another forum have their dates for the Majestic Colonial booked for all the way up to May 2010. \n \n Just wondering if anyone here has their date already or has had issues confirming a 2010 date?\n \n Thanks ladies!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I am looking to get a hotel in July 2010 in DR. my TA told me that I won&#039;t know until September, is this true?","Attachments":[],"Id":564877,"PostDate":1232329241,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>SunnyCherries<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">:::2010 BRIDES:::<br \/> <br \/> Does anyone have their dates confirmed for 2010 yet? I have contacted them to secure a date for Jan 2010 (as we are trying to get a group rate organized) and they have told me they are not booking 2010 weddings until April of this year. <br \/> <br \/> However, some girls on another forum have their dates for the Majestic Colonial booked for all the way up to May 2010. <br \/> <br \/> Just wondering if anyone here has their date already or has had issues confirming a 2010 date?<br \/> <br \/> Thanks ladies!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I am looking to get a hotel in July 2010 in DR. my TA told me that I won't know until September, is this true?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i>Jewels<\/i><\/div><\/div>","Email":"julie.sanchez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1232052946,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213986.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Steve&Julia","Id":213986,"Name":"Steve&Julia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fa383e84d5274f711e1bc76951ac3230","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Steve&amp;amp;Julia&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I am looking to get a hotel in July 2010 in DR. my TA told me that I won&#039;t know until September, is this true?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;From my understanding (and according to the email I received from the WC at the Majestic) they will not be booking 2010 weddings until April 2009. \n I should be getting quotes from my travel agent this week, so hopefully I can find out more information!!! \n \n I&#039;ve been on another forum and a few girls there have said that their dates at the Majestic were mmm dd, 2010 (I believe one of them was around May sometime) and I asked them if it was confirmed yet but didn&#039;t really get an answer from any of them. \n \n I&#039;m just scared that the Majestic is starting to book some, and not others. I would hate to have the deposit on my travel and then find out that we can&#039;t get married that week when April rolls around!!\n \n If anyone finds out anything, let us know! \n \n I&#039;ll for sure do the same :)","Attachments":[],"Id":564898,"PostDate":1232330391,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Steve&Julia<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I am looking to get a hotel in July 2010 in DR. my TA told me that I won't know until September, is this true?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>From my understanding (and according to the email I received from the WC at the Majestic) they will not be booking 2010 weddings until April 2009. <br \/> I should be getting quotes from my travel agent this week, so hopefully I can find out more information!!! <br \/> <br \/> I've been on another forum and a few girls there have said that their dates at the Majestic were mmm dd, 2010 (I believe one of them was around May sometime) and I asked them if it was confirmed yet but didn't really get an answer from any of them. <br \/> <br \/> I'm just scared that the Majestic is starting to book some, and not others. I would hate to have the deposit on my travel and then find out that we can't get married that week when April rolls around!!<br \/> <br \/> If anyone finds out anything, let us know! <br \/> <br \/> I'll for sure do the same <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>36 Booked!<\/strong><br><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.danandambie.com\">www.DanandAmbie.com<\/a><\/strong><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/w4r64qfilztm.png\">http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/w4r64qfilztm.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"amber.mackinnon@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1226293959,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212618.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SunnyCherries","Id":212618,"Name":"SunnyCherries","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1362,"TotalPages":137,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":1360},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
